msgstr "Una defensa de barco en potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP"
msgid "It won't save the boat from everything, but it sure kelps."
msgstr "No salgará al barco de todo, pero ayuda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "Una defensa de barco en potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL"
msgid "It gives the boat a little shellf defense."
msgstr "Le da un poco de conchadefensa al barco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "Una defensa de barco en potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD"
msgid "When you mess with a dragon boat, you get the horns!"
msgstr "¡Si te metes con un barco dragón, te llevarás un mordisco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
msgid "A soon-to-be boat bumper."
msgstr "Una defensa de barco en potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED"
msgid "The cannon is ready to fire!"
msgstr "¡El cañón está listo para disparar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "I should load it with something."
msgstr "Debería cargarlo con algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO"
msgid "I didn't forget the cannonballs, I'm just letting the anticipation build."
msgstr "No me he olvidado de las balas de cañón, solo estoy creando expectación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
msgid "It's not a cannon yet, but it will be."
msgstr "Todavía no es un cañón, pero lo será."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM"
msgid "It's technically a boat."
msgstr "Técnicamente es un barco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM"
msgid "It would be nice to do some experiments on the water."
msgstr "Estaría bien hacer unos cuantos experimentos en el agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "I should patch that up before we sink."
msgstr "Debería parchearlo antes de que nos hundamos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED"
msgid "It's working!! Er, I knew it would work, of course."
msgstr "¡Funciona! Aunque eso ya lo sabía, claro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm always drawn to physics, like a... ah, can't think of the word."
msgstr "La física me atrae, como un... Uh, no recuerdo cómo se llamaba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED"
msgid "Magnetism!"
msgstr "¡Magnetismo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC"
msgid "This will attract any strong magnets nearby."
msgstr "Esto atraerá a todos los imanes potentes de las inmediaciones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT"
msgid "One of my more genius ideas, if I do say so myself."
msgstr "Es una de mis mejores ideas, si se me permite decirlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR"
msgid "Things are going in the right direction. Or maybe the left."
msgstr "La cosa marcha viento en popa. O en proa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT"
msgid "I think I'll take it out for a spin."
msgstr "Voy a dar una vuelta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "If only it didn't also smell like a beefalo."
msgstr "Ojalá no oliese a beefalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "It's soggier than I would like."
msgstr "Está más húmeda de lo que me gustaría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "At least it smells nicer than the beefalo pillow."
msgstr "Por lo menos huele mejor que la almohada de beefalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Who would sleep on this?"
msgstr "¿Quién en su sano juicio dormiría en esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Botany and chemistry, working together."
msgstr "Botánica y química aunando fuerzas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD"
msgid "Our friend seems to be getting more in touch with his lunar roots."
msgstr "Parece que nuestro amigo se está familiarizando con sus raíces lunares."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Bits of bone."
msgstr "Trozos de hueso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "No bones about it, Warly can cook."
msgstr "Hasta los huesos alimentan, si Warly los cocina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "A stew to put some meat on your bones."
msgstr "Un guiso para calentar un poco los huesos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "I think the library's closed."
msgstr "Creo que la biblioteca está cerrada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Why study when I can experiment?"
msgstr "¿Para qué estudiar cuando puedo experimentar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "I don't get all the buzz around this one."
msgstr "Pues no es panal tanto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "No point studying when I can just wing it."
msgstr "No tiene sentido estudiarlos cuando puedo verlos volar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "The beginning was dull, but got better near the end."
msgstr "Al principio era aburrido, pero se puso interesante al final."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "I can't make out the text."
msgstr "No entiendo el texto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "I don't feel a burning need to read it."
msgstr "Paso de quemarme leyendo esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "It didn't really hook me."
msgstr "No ha conseguido engancharme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "This'll keep those monsters held for a little while."
msgstr "Esto contendrá a esos monstruos por un rato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "I see no farm in reading that."
msgstr "Hay que leer para cultivarse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "I see no farm in reading that."
msgstr "Hay que leer para cultivarse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "It's about as exciting as watching grass grow."
msgstr "Es casi tan emocionante como ver crecer la hierba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "Whoever wrote this must've been pretty bright."
msgstr "El que escribió esto debía ser brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "Brilliant!"
msgstr "¡Brillante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "All this interest in the moon is probably just a phase."
msgstr "Este interés por la luna no es más que una fase."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "That doesn't sound very scientific."
msgstr "Eso no suena muy científico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "Wickerbottom likes to do everything by the book."
msgstr "A Wickerbottom le gusta seguir las normas al pie de la letra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "I'll stick to my own experiments."
msgstr "Mejor sigo con mis experimentos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Strange, it's just 500 pages of telegraph codes."
msgstr "Qué raro, son solo 500 páginas de códigos de telégrafos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "My thoughts on it are only lukewarm."
msgstr "Me ha dejado bastante frío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Someone'll get suckered into reading this."
msgstr "Alguien quedará atrapado en su lectura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "I'm not scared of spiders! I'm not!"
msgstr "¡No me dan miedo las arañas! ¡De verdad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "Aerodynamical!"
msgstr "¡Aerodinámico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "Somewhere out there, a pirate is missing their bootie."
msgstr "En alguna parte hay un pirata sin bota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
msgid "It's broken, but I think I could repair it."
msgstr "Se ha roto, pero creo que se puede reparar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "If I get it hot enough, I could melt the pieces back together."
msgstr "Con suficiente calor, podría volver a soldar las piezas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "I bet the beefalo really like this."
msgstr "Apuesto a que al beefalo le gusta mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "For catching bugs."
msgstr "Para capturar insectos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Welp. It's kelp."
msgstr "Aggh. Algas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
msgid "I just couldn't kelp myself."
msgstr "Algo haré con las algas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
msgid "I can plant it in deep water."
msgstr "Puedo plantar esto en alta mar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "Our supplies are in there!"
msgstr "¡Nuestras provisiones están ahí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Wrapping things up should make them easier to carry."
msgstr "Las cosas envueltas son más fáciles de transportar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "I am filled with an irresistible urge to do science."
msgstr "Tengo un impulso irresistible de hacer ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW"
msgid "This one's luck has run out."
msgstr "Se le ha acabado la suerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It's all burnt up."
msgstr "Se ha quemado por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "It's kind of scratchy."
msgstr "Es un poco áspero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "I can't believe it's butter!"
msgstr "¡No puedo creerme que sea mantequilla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Butterfly, flutter by."
msgstr "Mariposa, mariposea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "Now I have you!"
msgstr "¡Ahora te tengo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "We threw the recipe away and just kind of winged it."
msgstr "Hemos probado esa receta y simplemente le han salido alas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Without these, it's just a butter."
msgstr "Sin estas, solo es mari."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "What a bizarre buzzard!"
msgstr "¡Qué águila ratonera más rara!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's what I call a firebird."
msgstr "Como un ave fénix."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I call fowl."
msgstr "Menudo pollo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's becoming a new species!"
msgstr "¡Se está transformando en una nueva especie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS"
msgid "The meat hides inside the cabbage to avoid predators."
msgstr "La carne se esconde dentro de la col para evitar depredadores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "Sharp but delicious."
msgstr "Pincha, pero es delicioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Deflated, but still spiny."
msgstr "Está desinflado, pero sigue pinchando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "A pretty flower from a prickly plant."
msgstr "Una hermosa flor de una planta espinosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "There are still some spines between me and a tasty meal."
msgstr "Aún hay algunos pinchos entre yo y una sabrosa comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Grilled fruit of the desert."
msgstr "Fruta del desierto a la plancha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL"
msgid "But I don't have chopsticks."
msgstr "Pero no tengo palillos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "That fire needs more fuel or it's going to go out."
msgstr "Esa hoguera necesita más fuego o se va a apagar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats darkness."
msgstr "Un método infalible contra la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is getting out of hand!"
msgstr "¡Ese fuego se está descontrolando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a bit low."
msgstr "El fuego se está apagando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "Well, that's over."
msgstr "Bien, se acabó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Some sort of yellow creature made of science."
msgstr "Una especie de criatura amarilla creada por la ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "I'm not squishing you, am I?"
msgstr "No te estoy aplastando, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "It's probably fine."
msgstr "Seguro que está bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "It's some sort of delicious pocket dimension for sugary treats."
msgstr "Algún tipo de deliciosa dimensión de bolsillo para golosinas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "Technically walking is just controlled falling."
msgstr "Técnicamente, caminar es solo una caída controlada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "This will fit into a cannon perfectly."
msgstr "Esto irá de perlas para el cañón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
msgid "What a blast!"
msgstr "¡Es la bomba!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "This experiment blows up on purpose!"
msgstr "¡Este experimento explota a propósito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "I've got a lot of experience in making things explode."
msgstr "Tengo experiencia en hacer explotar las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "I think all these shiny decorations reflect well on me."
msgstr "Creo que todas estas decoraciones brillantes reflejan mi yo interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "I have to build it myself? I should have known there'd be a catch."
msgstr "¿Tengo que hacerlo yo? Debí imaginarme que tendría truco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "I could watch it for hours."
msgstr "Podría estar viéndolo durante horas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "I hope this prize is all it's cracked up to be."
msgstr "Espero que este premio lo parta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "I seem to be getting a lot of these..."
msgstr "Tengo un montón de cosas como esta..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "See? Proof that trying the exact same thing over and over will eventually lead to success!"
msgstr "Aquí tenemos una prueba de que repetir lo mismo una y otra vez acaba dando sus frutos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "You don't see this kind of design too often."
msgstr "Este tipo de diseño no es muy común."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "The thrill of discovery!"
msgstr "¡Ay, la emoción de los descubrimientos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "The thrill of discovery!"
msgstr "¡Ay, la emoción de los descubrimientos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP"
msgid "It's powered by whimsy."
msgstr "Le da energía algo sin sentido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "Only some light work left to do."
msgstr "Ya solo queda lo fácil: ponerse con las luces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT"
msgid "Either it's small, or I'm gigantic."
msgstr "O es diminuta... o yo soy gigante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "Maybe it's a boxwood?"
msgstr "¿Será un boj?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "Is this drink supposed to be crunchy?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que la bebida tiene que ser crujiente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD"
msgid "I don't need to chew them up first, do I?"
msgstr "No tendré que masticarlos antes, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST"
msgid "It's a little trapdoor."
msgstr "Es una trampilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "This looks like fun!"
msgstr "¡Parece divertido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK"
msgid "Come back here!"
msgstr "¡Vuelve aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Those eggs are looking a little runny."
msgstr "Esos huevos están muy revueltos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a little trapdoor."
msgstr "Es una trampilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING"
msgid "Is this the right one?"
msgstr "¿Seguro que es esta?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Not to brag, but I've been called a bit of an egghead in the past."
msgstr "No es por presumir, pero alguna vez me han dicho que soy un genio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Physics don't always work the same way twice."
msgstr "La física casi nunca funciona dos veces de la misma forma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING"
msgid "Science compels me to press that big shiny button!"
msgstr "¡La ciencia me obliga a pulsar ese botón grande y brillante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "I could calculate the trajectory, but it involves a lot of complicated numbers and squiggles."
msgstr "Podría calcular la trayectoria, pero implicaría un montón de números y garabatos complicados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a little trapdoor."
msgstr "Es una trampilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING"
msgid "That target's really starting to bug me."
msgstr "Ese objetivo me está mosqueando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT"
msgid "This really is a pop-up carnival."
msgstr "Esta feria aparece y desaparece como si nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't let me play until I give it something shiny."
msgstr "No podré jugar hasta que le dé algo brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "It turns out that spinning your wheels is actually very productive."
msgstr "Resulta que lo de dar vueltas es bastante productivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "It's genius in its simplicity."
msgstr "Su sencillez es una genialidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID"
msgid "Good day to you, small bird person."
msgstr "Que tengas un buen día, pequeña ave humanoide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "One shiny token."
msgstr "Una ficha brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST"
msgid "What an odd fellow."
msgstr "Qué persona tan peculiar..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC"
msgid "It doesn't really scream \"Cawnival\" yet, does it?"
msgstr "Todavía no hay mucho ambiente de Cuerviferia, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2"
msgid "A little birdy told me it could use some more decorations around here."
msgstr "Un parajito me ha dicho que esto podría estar un poquito más decorado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
msgid "This tree is caws for celebration!"
msgstr "Cría cuervos y... ¡vendrán al árbol a celebrarlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "It's a scientifically proven fact that birds love trees."
msgstr "Está demostrado científicamente que a los pájaros les encantan los árboles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "I've got my eyes on the prize. That one, over there!"
msgstr "Ya sé lo que quiero... ¡Eso de ahí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "The real prize is the booth we made along the way."
msgstr "El verdadero premio es el puesto que montamos por el camino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC"
msgid "That's the ticket!"
msgstr "Aquí está el tíquet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK"
msgid "That's a lot of tickets!"
msgstr "¡Cuántos tíquets!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK"
msgid "That's the tickets!"
msgstr "Aquí están los tíquets."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I was feeling a bit peckish."
msgstr "Qué ganas tenía de picar algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "I think it makes me look adventurous."
msgstr "Me da un toque aventurero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "It's like wearing my own shade tree."
msgstr "Es como llevar mi propio árbol de sombra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "I hope there's no bugs in it..."
msgstr "Espero que no tenga bichos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "Razor-sharp, like my mind!"
msgstr "¡Afiladísima, como mi mente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
msgid "It doesn't make furniture anymore."
msgstr "Ya no hace muebles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "It makes furniture."
msgstr "Hace muebles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "Es su fin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Are carrots supposed to have legs?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que las zanahorias tienen patas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "You're kind of ugly up close."
msgstr "Eres un horror de cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's almost cute."
msgstr "Es casi adorable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
msgid "That's... disconcerting."
msgstr "Es... desconcertante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Yuck. This vegetable came out of the dirt."
msgstr "Puaj. Esta hortaliza ha salido de la tierra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Mushy."
msgstr "Qué blandita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That's one big bunch of carrots!"
msgstr "¡Qué montón de zanahorias gigantes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "The earth is making plantbabies."
msgstr "La tierra está haciendo plantas bebés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "So much for that."
msgstr "Se acabó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing but ash now."
msgstr "Ahora solo queda ceniza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Now I can show everyone what I found!"
msgstr "¡Ahora puedo enseñarle a todo el mundo lo que he encontrado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "A playful little thing."
msgstr "Una cosita juguetona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "Its owner ran out of lives."
msgstr "Su dueño se quedó sin vidas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a den in a stump."
msgstr "Es una guarida en un tronco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Ears hat!"
msgstr "¡Un gorro con orejas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "Mice with wheels, what will science think up next?"
msgstr "Ratones con ruedas, ¿qué más inventará la ciencia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "I think I can lift this one."
msgstr "Creo que puedo levantarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "It's out of reach."
msgstr "No está a mi alcance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "It's mushy."
msgstr "Es blandita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "Not my fault!"
msgstr "¡No es culpa mía!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Yum!"
msgstr "¡Qué rico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "It's dubiously photosynthetical."
msgstr "Es dudosamente fotosintético."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "I wonder if that rock could be moved."
msgstr "Me pregunto si esa roca se puede quitar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "I'll have to wait until someone leaves to enter."
msgstr "Tendré que esperar a que alguien salga para entrar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "The earth itself rejects me!"
msgstr "¡La propia tierra me rechaza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "I bet there's all sorts of things to discover down there."
msgstr "Apuesto a que hay todo tipo de cosas por descubrir ahí dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "It's probably hiding something."
msgstr "Probablemente oculta algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "The surface is too crowded!"
msgstr "¡La superficie también está llena de gente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll just stay down here, I suppose."
msgstr "Me quedaré aquí abajo, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "I've had enough discovery for now."
msgstr "Ya he descubierto suficiente por ahora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "It's a fern."
msgstr "Es un helecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED"
msgid "It's a withered fern."
msgstr "Es un helecho marchito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD"
msgid "Out of gas!"
msgstr "¡Se ha quedado sin fuelle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC"
msgid "What mite it be?"
msgstr "¿En qué se termitará convirtiendo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Careful, it mite wake up."
msgstr "Cuidado, no creo que nos termita despertarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING"
msgid "It's fuming mad!"
msgstr "¡Está que echa humo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS"
msgid "That's exhausting."
msgstr "Un gran escape."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not sure which way it vent."
msgstr "Acabará explotando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "Things are really heating up."
msgstr "Empiezo a entrar en calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "What about miasma?"
msgstr "¿Y qué pasa con miasma?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "It's a climbing rope."
msgstr "Es una cuerda de escalada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Can I get a bigger bowl? This one looks a little shrimpy."
msgstr "¿Hay un cuenco más grande? Este parece un poco pequeño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "It's small, dark, and smells like burnt wood."
msgstr "Es pequeño, oscuro y huele a madera quemada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "It wants something dreadful."
msgstr "Quiere algo horrible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "They're just here to stir up drama."
msgstr "Solo han venido a montar un drama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "Is someone doing a play?"
msgstr "¿Alguien está haciendo una obra?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "Wait, is that...?"
msgstr "Un momento, ¿esa es...?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "It's a setup! It feels too... staged."
msgstr "¡Es un montaje! Parece muy poco... natural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "A pile of broken chess pieces."
msgstr "Un montón de piezas de ajedrez rotas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "Another pile of broken chess pieces."
msgstr "Otro montón de piezas de ajedrez rotas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "Even more broken chess pieces."
msgstr "Aún más piezas de ajedrez rotas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "It's as heavy as it looks."
msgstr "Pesa tanto como parece."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "A stagn-antlion."
msgstr "Una paral-eon-zación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "It was a lot bigger up close."
msgstr "Era mucho más grande de cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "Somehow it seems crankier than the real one."
msgstr "Parece incluso más gruñón que el de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "This sculpture is pretty beefy."
msgstr "Impone casi tanto como los de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Very statuesque."
msgstr "Muy escultural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a stone bishop."
msgstr "Un alfil de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "The chess pieces are moving themselves!"
msgstr "¡Las piezas de ajedrez se están moviendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "It looks nice, doesn't it?"
msgstr "Es una preciosidad, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "We have a winner!"
msgstr "¡Tenemos un ganador!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "It would probably make a great scratching post."
msgstr "Sería un rascador ideal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "That thing's the leashed of my worries."
msgstr "Esa cosa es el motivo de mis preocupaciones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "And I didn't even get eaten!"
msgstr "¡Y ni siquiera me han comido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "Still not as crabby as Maxwell."
msgstr "Tiene mejor carácter que Maxwell."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "Now he's off who-knows-were."
msgstr "Se ha ido. Vete tú a saber a dónde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "This belongs in a junkpile!"
msgstr "¡Esto debería estar en un vertedero!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "It feels like its eye follows you."
msgstr "Es como si su ojo te siguiera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "This sculpture is a bit of an eyesore."
msgstr "Salta a la vista que esta escultura es una monstruosidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "It's a worm, figures."
msgstr "Es un gusano. Qué figura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Ah, that brings back memories. Bad ones."
msgstr "Ah, qué recuerdos. Malos recuerdos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "It's giving me a stony stare."
msgstr "La mirada más dura que he visto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "Doesn't seem very \"kingly\" to me."
msgstr "No me parece muy \"regio\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "I much prefer it this way."
msgstr "Me gusta mucho más así."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "Makes my stomach rumble just looking at it."
msgstr "Se me revuelve el estómago solo con mirarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "These ones are much easier to find."
msgstr "Estos no son tan difíciles de encontrar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "Can I invoke the \"no holiday decorations\" Klaus?"
msgstr "¿Puedo invocar al Klaus \"sin decoración festiva\"?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a horse, of course."
msgstr "Un caballo, por supuesto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "The chess pieces are moving themselves!"
msgstr "¡Las piezas de ajedrez se están moviendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "It's not so bad when it isn't trying to kill you."
msgstr "No es tan indeseable cuando no intenta matarte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "I want to hug it, but the stone chafes."
msgstr "Quiero abrazarlo, pero la piedra raspa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "Now you're the one scared stiff!"
msgstr "¡Ahora quien tiene miedo eres tú!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "I've been feeling pretty inspired lately."
msgstr "Siento mucha inspiración últimamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "Eurgh. It's so lifelike."
msgstr "Puaj. Es muy real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "Hmm... Looks familiar."
msgstr "Hmm... Me suena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "I can relate."
msgstr "Sé cómo te sientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "That was never really my thing."
msgstr "Esto nunca ha sido lo mío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "It's even heavier than it looks."
msgstr "Es incluso más pesada de lo que parece."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "The chess pieces are moving themselves!"
msgstr "¡Las piezas de ajedrez se están moviendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "There's just some-fin about it."
msgstr "Qué marrajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "Exactly as stationary as a skeleton should be."
msgstr "Tan inmóvil como debería estar un esqueleto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "Not really a great stool though, is it?"
msgstr "En realidad no es un gran taburete, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "That was a terrible night of very uncomfortable eye contact."
msgstr "Una noche entera del contacto visual más incómodo de la historia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "This one is short on height."
msgstr "Esta es bastante cortita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "I'm over the moon."
msgstr "Estoy en la luna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "Great design, questionable execution."
msgstr "Diseño de primera, ejecución de pena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "It's just missing that horrible breath."
msgstr "Solo le falta el mal aliento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "It still shakes me up."
msgstr "Me estremezco solo con verlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "Just the sight of it gets my heart racing!"
msgstr "¡Me emociono solo con verla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "That was a rough knight."
msgstr "Era de armas tomar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "I usually try to stay away from gold diggers."
msgstr "No es oro todo lo que reluce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "Otto von Chesterfield, Esq."
msgstr "Sr. Otto von Chesterfield"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's looking at me."
msgstr "Me está mirando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "It went to sleep."
msgstr "Se ha quedado dormido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "The laws of physics are surprisingly flexible."
msgstr "Las leyes de la física son sorprendentemente flexibles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "Horrible! Definitely horrible!"
msgstr "¡Qué horror! ¡Horripilante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHUM"
msgid "It's a fish meal!"
msgstr "¡Es una comida de peces!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "It's been unleashed!"
msgstr "¡Le han desatado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "It looks so real."
msgstr "Parece tan real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "A terror cotta monster!"
msgstr "¡Un terrorífico monstruo de terracota!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "Did it just move?"
msgstr "¿Se acaba de mover?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "That fire needs more fuel or it's going to go out."
msgstr "Esa hoguera necesita más fuego o se va a apagar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats darkness."
msgstr "Un método infalible contra la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is getting out of hand!"
msgstr "¡Ese fuego se está descontrolando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a bit low."
msgstr "El fuego se está apagando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "Well, that's over."
msgstr "Bien, se acabó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "I should put something on the fire before it goes out."
msgstr "Debería echar algo al fuego antes de que se apague."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats darkness."
msgstr "Un método infalible contra la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "Good thing it's contained!"
msgstr "¡Menos mal que está controlado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a bit low."
msgstr "El fuego se está apagando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "At least I can start it up again."
msgstr "Al menos puedo encenderlo de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST"
msgid "The laws of physics have been bent and broken."
msgstr "Las leyes de la física se han retorcido y se han roto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "Este."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Which way am I facing?"
msgstr "¿Hacia dónde estoy mirando?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North."
msgstr "Norte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast."
msgstr "Nordeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest."
msgstr "Noroeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "South."
msgstr "Sur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast."
msgstr "Sureste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "Sudoeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "Oeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOST"
msgid "Food for plants, and not much else."
msgstr "Comida para las plantas y poco más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "Just right!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "I didn't think it could smell any worse..."
msgstr "Creía que no podía oler peor..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "Hm... too dry."
msgstr "Um... Está muy seco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I can barrel-y stand the smell."
msgstr "Cómo puede oler tan mal un solo barril..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET"
msgid "That looks too soggy."
msgstr "Está demasiado húmedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP"
msgid "Wormwood offered me a bite, but I respectfully declined."
msgstr "Wormwood me ha ofrecido probar, pero he declinado amablemente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "Stuff for science!"
msgstr "¡Material para la ciencia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK"
msgid "I've always been hungry for knowledge."
msgstr "Siempre he tenido hambre de conocimientos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "Poor little guy."
msgstr "Pobrecita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "Charbroiled to perfection."
msgstr "Asado al carbón a la perfección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "That's only somewhat more appetizing than when it was raw."
msgstr "Es solo un poco más apetecible que cuando estaba crudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "Now there's no reason to worry about getting worms!"
msgstr "¡Ahora no hay motivo para preocuparse de que salgan gusanos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER"
msgid "I don't like the way it's looking at my boat..."
msgstr "No me gusta cómo mira mi barco..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT"
msgid "At least my hair will stay dry."
msgstr "Al menos mi pelo seguirá seco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL"
msgid "A shell of its former self."
msgstr "Una carcasa de su antiguo ser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Science help me, I can't decipher this handwriting."
msgstr "Que la ciencia me ayude, no hay quien entienda esta letra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "The pot got cooked."
msgstr "La olla esta lista."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "This is going to take a while."
msgstr "Esto va a tardar un poco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "It's almost done!"
msgstr "¡Ya casi está!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Mmmmm! It's ready to eat!"
msgstr "¡Mmmmm! ¡Listo para comer!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "It makes me hungry just to look at it."
msgstr "Me da hambre solo de mirarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COOLANT"
msgid "It's bubbling with possibility!"
msgstr "¡Rebosante de posibilidades!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "I think it's still swishing."
msgstr "Creo que todavía está silbando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "High in fructose!"
msgstr "¡Rico en fructosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked and high in fructose!"
msgstr "¡Cocinado y rico en fructosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What a big ear you have!"
msgstr "¡Qué hojas más grandes tienes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY"
msgid "It's a blacksmith costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de herrera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY"
msgid "It's a doll costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de muñeca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY"
msgid "It's a fool's costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de bufón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY"
msgid "It's a King costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de rey."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY"
msgid "It's a costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY"
msgid "Ignore the neigh-sayers."
msgstr "Relinchan, señal que cabalgamos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY"
msgid "It's a Queen costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de reina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY"
msgid "It's a tree costume."
msgstr "Es un disfraz de árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC"
msgid "It needs some fuel."
msgstr "Necesita combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT"
msgid "What a soothing light."
msgstr "Qué luz tan relajante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC"
msgid "It needs some fuel."
msgstr "Necesita combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
msgid "What an inspirational figure!"
msgstr "¡Una figura muy inspiradora!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC"
msgid "It needs some fuel."
msgstr "Necesita combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT"
msgid "I could stare at it forever... and ever..."
msgstr "Podría quedarme mirándolo para siempre... jamás..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET"
msgid "What a crowning achievement."
msgstr "La coronación del esfuerzo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "They look so cozy."
msgstr "Parece que están cómodos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "Yikes! A little too crabby for me."
msgstr "¡Puf! No me van los crustáceos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "That castle needs a little decoration."
msgstr "Ese castillo necesita un poco de decoración."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "I knew there was mortar these crabs."
msgstr "Sabía que estos cangrejos tenían un as en la pinza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "That's claws for alarm!"
msgstr "¡Esas pinzas son alarmantes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "This is between me and the crab."
msgstr "Esto queda entre el cangrejo y yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "Crabby much?"
msgstr "Rabia la casca, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "This shell be quite the challenge."
msgstr "Este va a ser duro de pelar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "Is there something in there?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo ahí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "You'd never do anything rotten, would you?"
msgstr "No estás podrido hasta la médula, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "It's wyrmed its way into my heart."
msgstr "Ha llegado volando a mi corazón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS"
msgid "Behold, a man."
msgstr "Mirad, un hombre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Always good to have another set of eyes! Er... eye."
msgstr "¡Un par de ojos extra nunca vienen mal! O... ojo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "What an aerodynamical creature!"
msgstr "¡Qué criatura tan aerodinámica!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "You'd make a good lab assistant."
msgstr "Serías un buen asistente de laboratorio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "Much less mucusy than its momma."
msgstr "Tiene menos mucosidad que su mamá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "I keep her around because she's good at mothematics."
msgstr "La tengo por aquí porque se le dan bien las matemáticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "My feathered friend."
msgstr "Mi amigo con plumas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Pretty cute for a lil monster!"
msgstr "¡Es muy bonito para ser un pequeño monstruo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Creepy!"
msgstr "¡Qué miedo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "He's not very happy in there."
msgstr "No es muy feliz aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "A crummy way to hide yourself."
msgstr "Una forma deliciosa de esconderse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "It seems harmless."
msgstr "Parece inofensiva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "Cut grass, ready for arts and crafts."
msgstr "Hierba cortada, lista para hacer artesanías."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "What it lacks in slicing it makes up for in splinters."
msgstr "Lo que le falta de afilada lo compensa con las astillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Nutritious, but it won't last long."
msgstr "Nutritivo, pero no por mucho tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Cut reeds, ready for crafting and hobbying."
msgstr "Juncos cortados, listos para fabricar cosas y hacer artesanía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Seductively smooth."
msgstr "Seductoramente suave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Freeing him might not have been my best idea."
msgstr "Creo que liberarlo no ha sido la mejor idea que he tenido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "I feel almost sorry for him."
msgstr "Casi me da hasta pena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "He's trapped under all that junk."
msgstr "Está atrapado bajo toda esa chatarra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's not upset him."
msgstr "Evitemos molestarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "He seems upset."
msgstr "Parece molesto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "A pillar of impossibly hard stone."
msgstr "Un pilar de una piedra increíblemente dura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "There's something glinting inside the marble."
msgstr "Hay algo que brilla dentro del mármol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "A most potent dish."
msgstr "Un plato muy potente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "That's what they get for coming up on land."
msgstr "Eso les pasa por venir a tierra firme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "What a waste of wood."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "I feel like I could have prevented that."
msgstr "Creo que podría haberlo evitado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Take that, nature!"
msgstr "¡Chúpate esa, naturaleza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's all leafy. Most of the time."
msgstr "Es muy frondoso. La mayor parte del tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "It looks unhappy about me stealing those birchnuts!"
msgstr "¡Parece que no le gusta que le robe las nueces de abedul!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Are we playing with a full deck?"
msgstr "¿Vamos a jugar con toda la baraja?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "How sophisticated."
msgstr "Qué sofisticado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "A nice vase without any flowers."
msgstr "Un buen jarrón, pero sin flores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "It's nice to have a little light."
msgstr "Es bueno tener un poco de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "A nice vase of flowers."
msgstr "Un buen jarrón de flores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "I know I told Maxwell to replace the bulb."
msgstr "Recuerdo haberle dicho a Maxwell que cambiase la bombilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "Not looking very fresh."
msgstr "No parece muy fresca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "A welcoming light."
msgstr "Una luz muy acogedora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "It's beautiful."
msgstr "Qué preciosidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "I should draw something in this."
msgstr "Debería dibujar algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "Looking good!"
msgstr "¡Tiene buen aspecto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "What an impressive antler!"
msgstr "¡Qué cornamenta tan impresionante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it staring at me? ...No, I guess not."
msgstr "¿Me está mirando a mí...? No, supongo que no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "It's enormous!!"
msgstr "¡¡Es enorme!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Can't be too careful."
msgstr "Toda precaución es poca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's over... right?"
msgstr "Se acabó... ¿Verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "I don't want to believe what my eyes are seeing!"
msgstr "¡No me creo lo que ven mis ojos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "How's that for an icy gaze?"
msgstr "Esa sí que es una mirada fría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "Someone lose an eye?"
msgstr "¿Alguien ha perdido un ojo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "Stand back everyone, I am a trained scientist!"
msgstr "¡Atrás todos, soy científico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "This is really gross."
msgstr "Esto es realmente asqueroso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "Was that supposed to come off?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que eso se puede quitar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "It's being controlled by that beast!"
msgstr "¡Esa bestia la controla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's probably a tuft of grass."
msgstr "Es probablemente un manojo de hierba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Quality eye protection."
msgstr "Protección ocular de calidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "Just dry and dry again!"
msgstr "¡Secar y volver a secar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "It leaves me high and dry!"
msgstr "¡Te deja seco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL"
msgid "It smells of bacon!"
msgstr "¡Huele a tocino!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV"
msgid "I'm not strong enough to wield it."
msgstr "No soy lo bastante fuerte como para hacerla funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "It's a pile of dirt... or IS it?"
msgstr "Es un montón de tierra... ¿o no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "The signal is very faint."
msgstr "La señal es muy débil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It's some kind of homing device."
msgstr "Es una especie de dispositivo de rastreo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "This thing's going crazy!"
msgstr "¡Este chisme se está volviendo loco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "I'm headed in the right direction."
msgstr "Voy en la dirección correcta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Must be getting pretty close."
msgstr "Debo de estar acercándome mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what it does."
msgstr "Me pregunto qué hará."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It looks like it needs a large key."
msgstr "Parece que necesita una llave grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "Now the machine can work!"
msgstr "¡Ahora la máquina puede funcionar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "That rod looks useful!"
msgstr "¡Esa vara parece útil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "Everything I need to build a dock for my boat."
msgstr "Todo lo necesario para construir un muelle para mi barco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "Aha! I thought the dock was missing something."
msgstr "¡Ajá! Sabía que al muelle le faltaba algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "My beefalo will look as cute as a button!"
msgstr "¡Mi beefalo va a quedar como un figurín!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "I'd better stop dragon my feet and build it."
msgstr "Será mejor que deje de holgazanear y me ponga a construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "Boat building made easy!"
msgstr "¡La construcción de barcos simplificada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "I'm middling on this middle piece."
msgstr "Estoy entre medias en el medio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "I hope I can handle the spice level."
msgstr "Espero poder lidiar con el nivel de especias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "That's one fly dragon!"
msgstr "¡Es un dragón que revolotea!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Next best thing to a lockbox!"
msgstr "¡Lo mejor después de un cofre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "The amount of storage is off the scale!"
msgstr "¡Todo este almacenamiento me escama!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "Produces a lot of heat, but not much light."
msgstr "Produce mucho calor, pero no mucha luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "I don't think it's supposed to look like that."
msgstr "Creo que esto normalmente no está así."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "It's scalding!"
msgstr "¡Está ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "Is it winking at me?"
msgstr "¿Me está guiñando un ojo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "What a weird fruit."
msgstr "Qué fruta tan extraña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "The fruit's still weird."
msgstr "Qué fruta tan extraña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I half expect it to sprout wings."
msgstr "No me extrañaría que le salieran alas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "So who gets to be the head?"
msgstr "¿Y para quién es la cabeza?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "The dragonfruit is very filling."
msgstr "La pitahaya llena mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "Someone has to bring up the rear."
msgstr "Alguien tiene que ir a la cola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "They're still warm."
msgstr "Aún están calientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "It seems to reflect shadows instead of light."
msgstr "Es como si reflejase las sombras en lugar de la luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "To keep my brilliant brain safe and sound."
msgstr "Para mantener mi brillante cerebro a salvo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "It's coming from deep down in those chasms..."
msgstr "Ha salido de las profundidades de esas grietas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "It floats on water."
msgstr "Flota en el agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "That driftwood's burning!"
msgstr "¡Esa madera a la deriva está ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Doesn't look very useful anymore."
msgstr "Ya no parece demasiado útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "There might still be something worth digging up."
msgstr "A lo mejor aún queda algo que merezca la pena sacar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A dead tree that washed up on shore."
msgstr "Un árbol muerto arrastrado a la orilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "Ready for gobbling."
msgstr "Listo para engullirlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Even better for gobbling!"
msgstr "¡Aún mejor para engullirlo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "That bush is bananas!"
msgstr "¡Un arbusto de plátanos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Now it can be taken anywhere."
msgstr "Ahora se puede llevar a cualquier lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "This could be replanted closer to home."
msgstr "Podría replantarlo cerca de casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "It can be planted anywhere now."
msgstr "Ahora se puede plantar en cualquier lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "This needs to be planted."
msgstr "Hay que plantar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "I wonder if they're edible? Maybe an experiment is in order."
msgstr "¿Serán comestibles? Creo que es hora de hacer un experimento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "This needs to be planted."
msgstr "Hay que plantar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "It's not fooling anyone now."
msgstr "Ya no engaña a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "I usually let my mind do all the heavy lifting."
msgstr "Yo soy más de ejercitar el cerebro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "You can't get much cooler than that."
msgstr "Ya no se puede enfriar mucho más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "I'll conquer this weight with the power of-- ACK! My spine!!"
msgstr "Levantaré este peso con el poder de mi... ¡AY! ¡Mi espalda!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "It's worth its weight in gold."
msgstr "Vale su peso en oro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "It's good for a warm-up."
msgstr "Está bien para el calentamiento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "I've trained my brain to be the strongest muscle in my body."
msgstr "He entrenado a mi cerebro para que sea el músculo más fuerte de mi cuerpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "It'll really make you feel the burn."
msgstr "Te hará sentir el calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Oh, it smells!"
msgstr "¡Ah, cómo huele!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Now it smells even worse!"
msgstr "¡Ahora huele aún peor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'm sure it'll make an even bigger stink."
msgstr "Seguro que apestará muchísimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "Who or what would eat this?"
msgstr "¿Quién o qué se comería esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "Tidy little guys, aren't they?"
msgstr "Qué pulcras que son, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "They're snug as bugs in there."
msgstr "Están como bicho por su casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Makes you warm and fuzzy inside. Outside, too."
msgstr "Te calienta por dentro. Y por fuera también."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "This will make a delicious meal."
msgstr "Esto será una deliciosa comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "Smells great!"
msgstr "¡Huele muy bien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "It doesn't look like an egg."
msgstr "Qué planta más rara."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "It's even less eggy."
msgstr "Es aún más extraña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I still don't see any resemblance to an egg."
msgstr "Es la prima morada del calabacín."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "That's more of a mortician's bag than a basket."
msgstr "Se parece más a la bolsa de un enterrador que a una cesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "A fire without fuel? No matter."
msgstr "¿Un fuego sin combustible? No pasa nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "A burnt vase on a burnt table."
msgstr "Un jarrón quemado en una mesa quemada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I should put something in there."
msgstr "Debería poner algo ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "It's nice to have a little light."
msgstr "Es bueno tener un poco de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A flower in a vase on a table."
msgstr "Una flor en un jarrón sobre una mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "Did we remember to pick up new bulbs?"
msgstr "¿Nos hemos acordado de traer bombillas nuevas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "Not looking too fresh."
msgstr "No parece muy nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "What a waste of wood."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "I feel like I could have prevented that."
msgstr "Creo que podría haberlo evitado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "Take that, nature!"
msgstr "¡Chúpate esa, naturaleza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's all piney."
msgstr "Es todo un pino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "What a waste of wood."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "I feel like I could have prevented that."
msgstr "Creo que podría haberlo evitado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Take that, nature!"
msgstr "¡Chúpate esa, naturaleza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "This sad tree has no cones."
msgstr "Este triste árbol no tiene piñas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "It watches over the wearer."
msgstr "Vigila a quien lo lleva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "You could say I have an eye for style."
msgstr "Podría decirse que tengo buen ojo para la moda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Go for the eye!"
msgstr "¡Ataca al ojo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "I'm starting to feel self-conscious."
msgstr "Me da un poco de cosita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "I think it's about to hatch..."
msgstr "Creo que está a punto de eclosionar..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "I think I'm being watched."
msgstr "Creo que me están observando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "I hope it doesn't turn on me."
msgstr "Espero que no me mire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "I think it's sleeping."
msgstr "Creo que está durmiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "I don't think anything will grow in a pile of ash."
msgstr "No creo que nada crezca en un montón de cenizas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "I should try planting some crops."
msgstr "Debería tratar de sembrar algunos cultivos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Go plants go!"
msgstr "¡Vamos plantas, vamos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "I think it needs to be fertilized."
msgstr "Creo que necesita ser fertilizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "I have to make the ground more comfortable for the seeds."
msgstr "Tengo que preparar mejor el suelo para que las semillas estén cómodas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "That can't be good for the plants..."
msgstr "Eso no puede ser bueno para las plantas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Time to reap science's rewards."
msgstr "Hora de cosechar las recompensas de la ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "With the power of science, I've produced monstrous produce!"
msgstr "¡He creado un producto monstruoso gracias al poder de la ciencia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "I knew I'd weed out the imposter eventually!"
msgstr "Sabía que acabaría arrancando a la impostora..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a plant!"
msgstr "¡Es una planta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "Grow my beautiful creation, grow!"
msgstr "Crece, mi hermosa creación, ¡crece!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "Drat! If only I'd picked it while I had the chance!"
msgstr "¡Maldición! Si me hubiera puesto a cosechar cuando tocaba..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What rotten luck."
msgstr "Qué mala suerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "And now, we wait."
msgstr "Hora de esperar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "A convenient plot device."
msgstr "Qué herramienta tan útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better find a good spot for my garden before I use it."
msgstr "Será mejor que encuentre un lugar ideal para la huerta antes de usar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "It's making a mess of my garden."
msgstr "La huerta está hecha un desastre por su culpa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "Down, to bring the temperature down."
msgstr "Menos calor, quiero menos calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "BECOME THE BIRD!"
msgstr "¡CONVIÉRTETE EN PÁJARO!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "The feather increases the scientific properties of the writing."
msgstr "La pluma aumenta las propiedades científicas de la escritura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "A canary feather."
msgstr "Una pluma de canario."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "A feather from a black bird."
msgstr "Una pluma de un pájaro negro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "A redbird feather."
msgstr "Una pluma de petirrojo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "A snowbird feather."
msgstr "Una pluma de pinzón de las nieves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She's trapped!"
msgstr "¡Está atrapada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "It's just a wood fence."
msgstr "No es más que una valla de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "It is not functional as a standalone unit."
msgstr "No funciona de forma autónoma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "Aw, it found a connection."
msgstr "Oh, ha encontrado una conexión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "It's not a tree, but it must be planted."
msgstr "No es un árbol, pero hay que plantarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "It opens. And closes sometimes, too."
msgstr "Se abre. Y a veces también se cierra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "All we need to build a nice, sturdy gate."
msgstr "Todo lo que necesitamos para construir una buena puerta resistente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "All we need to build a nice, sturdy fence."
msgstr "Todo lo que necesitamos para construir una buena valla resistente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "Tell me it's ugly, I won't take a fence."
msgstr "Vaya, me da igual que os parezca fea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "Enguard! Re-post!"
msgstr "¡En guardia! ¡Estacada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "That is definitely a bucket full of poop."
msgstr "Es sin duda un cubo lleno de estiércol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "I wouldn't mind sampling some seasonal seafood."
msgstr "No me importaría probar un poco de marisco de temporada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "This is just the occasion for some festivity!"
msgstr "¡Es el momento perfecto para sacar el espíritu festivo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "I'll call it \"Newton's Fig\"."
msgstr "Lo llamaré \"higo de Newton\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "Mama mia!"
msgstr "¡Mamma mia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "Fig with a side of stick."
msgstr "Érase una vez un higo a un palo pegado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "It's been warmed by science."
msgstr "Lo ha calentado la ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "It calls a meteor from above."
msgstr "Invoca un meteorito de los cielos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Filled with explosion science!"
msgstr "¡Llenos de ciencia explosiva!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "If only I could catch them!"
msgstr "¡Si pudiera atraparlas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "They make my pocket glow!"
msgstr "¡Hacen brillar mi bolsillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "That one is glowy."
msgstr "Ese es resplandeciente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "If you can't stand the heat, stay out of the garden."
msgstr "Si no aguantas bien el calor, no te acerques a la huerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "Nice dry."
msgstr "Todo bien sequito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "Strike while the pen's hot!"
msgstr "¡Golpea cuando esté caliente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "I should put something on the fire before it goes out."
msgstr "Debería echar algo al fuego antes de que se apague."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats darkness."
msgstr "Un método infalible contra la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "Good thing it's contained!"
msgstr "¡Menos mal que está controlado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a bit low."
msgstr "El fuego se está apagando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Agradable y confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "At least I can start it up again."
msgstr "Al menos puedo encenderlo de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "I don't want to set the world on fire."
msgstr "No quiero prender el mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "The fuel tank is getting a bit low."
msgstr "El depósito de combustible se está vaciando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "All quiet on the flinging front."
msgstr "Sin novedad en el frente del fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Fling on!"
msgstr "¡Sistema activado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Now I shall eat for a day."
msgstr "Ahora debo comer por un día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "Nothing but net."
msgstr "Nada más que una red."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "Hook, line and stick!"
msgstr "¡Anzuelo, hilo y caña!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "A chunk of fish meat."
msgstr "Un trozo de carne de pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Grilled to perfection."
msgstr "Perfectamente asado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "That fish is a real jerk."
msgstr "Ese pez es un cecino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "A small bit of fish."
msgstr "Un pequeño trozo de pescado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "A small bit of cooked fish."
msgstr "Un poco de pescado asado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "That fish is a real jerk."
msgstr "Ese pez es un cecino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Sticks to your ribs."
msgstr "Se pega a las costillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Crunchy and delicious!"
msgstr "¡Crujiente y deliciosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "They're stuffed in there like sardines!"
msgstr "¡Están embutidos como sardinas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Grilled to perfection."
msgstr "Perfectamente asado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "It's a very sharp rock."
msgstr "Es una piedra muy afilada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Admit deflate!"
msgstr "¡Ha perdido fuelle!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "There we glow!"
msgstr "¡Flotando y brillando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "The trick is to let it go."
msgstr "La clave está en dejarlo ir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
