#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
