msgstr "Creo que podría haberlo evitado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Take that, nature!"
msgstr "¡Chúpate esa, naturaleza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks sick. More so than usual."
msgstr "Parece enfermo. Más que de costumbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's all stick-y."
msgstr "Qué palo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "There's a stick-y tree inside it that wants to get out."
msgstr "Hay un árbol muy recto en su interior que quiere salir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "It doesn't need any help to grow."
msgstr "No necesita ayuda para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "That tree looks pretty wimpy."
msgstr "Ese árbol parece bastante debilucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "It's a bunch of small twigs."
msgstr "Es un montón de pequeñas ramitas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1"
msgid "Maybe they're friendly? ...Maybe not."
msgstr "¿Será simpático?... Puede que no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2"
msgid "Maybe they're friendly? ...Maybe not."
msgstr "¿Será simpático?... Puede que no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "I always hate when my hair gets wet and poofy."
msgstr "Odio cuando se me moja el pelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "I hope this doesn't make anyone eel!"
msgstr "¡Esto de comer anguilas... no me deja muy tranquila!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It doesn't look finished! It could be dangerous."
msgstr "¡No parece terminado! ¡Podría ser peligroso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN"
msgid "Light's out."
msgstr "Sin luces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing compass to this."
msgstr "Parece cosa de bujulería."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM"
msgid "It was leading me to this room."
msgstr "Me ha conducido a esta sala."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT"
msgid "It doesn't seem to work here."
msgstr "Parece que no funciona en este sitio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "It just had to drop in, right when I was on a roll!"
msgstr "¡Tenía que dejarse caer justo cuando todo iba sobre ruedas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED"
msgid "Fits like a bulb!"
msgstr "¡Encaja como una bombilla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER"
msgid "It's just a mysterious lever, what's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "Solo es una palanca misteriosa, ¿qué podría salir mal?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR"
msgid "Is it meant to keep something in, or keep something out?"
msgstr "¿Es para mantener algo dentro... o fuera?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER"
msgid "How mysterious..."
msgstr "Qué misterio..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY"
msgid "Did I finally find the key to going home?"
msgstr "¿He dado al fin con la clave para volver a casa?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR"
msgid "There's an idea that's sparked in my mind..."
msgstr "Se me ha encendido la bombillita..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT"
msgid "I can't tie a rope here."
msgstr "No puedo atarle una cuerda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "There's the key to it all."
msgstr "Hay que dar con la clave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr "Está vacío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT"
msgid "If I tied a rope, I could climb back out."
msgstr "Podría volver a subir si consiguiese atar una cuerda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB"
msgid "I think this plays a roll."
msgstr "Todo sobre ruedas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED"
msgid "It really moves me."
msgstr "Es conmovedor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "We might've gotten off to a rocky start..."
msgstr "Puede que hayamos tenido un comienzo escabroso..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR"
msgid "What else does it need?"
msgstr "¿Qué más quiere?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS"
msgid "I need a good spot to place this."
msgstr "Tengo que buscarle un buen sitio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED"
msgid "Nothing gets past this guy!"
msgstr "¡No se le escapa nada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT"
msgid "It's a tower."
msgstr "Es una torre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED"
msgid "It just needs a spark of inspiration!"
msgstr "¡Solo hay que darle un poco de chispa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE"
msgid "This must be an important piece of that walking tower."
msgstr "Debe ser una parte muy importante de esa torre andante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL"
msgid "This technology is ancient!"
msgstr "¡Esta tecnología es antiquísima!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE"
msgid "I can't read that."
msgstr "No sé qué significa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1"
msgid "Looks like he met a dark end..."
msgstr "Parece que su destino fue muy oscuro..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2"
msgid "This really bugs me."
msgstr "Hay algo que me escama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3"
msgid "They make a pointed argument."
msgstr "Un argumento muy agudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN"
msgid "It's broken."
msgstr "Está roto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC"
msgid "This piece really moves me."
msgstr "Una pieza conmovedora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED"
msgid "It needs power."
msgstr "Necesita energía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION"
msgid "\"This Waymark is under development for a future update.\""
msgstr "\"Este marcador está en desarrollo para futuras actualizaciones\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN"
msgid "The switch looks broken."
msgstr "Parece que el interruptor se ha roto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that a light switch?"
msgstr "¿Eso es un interruptor?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET"
msgid "Breakfast is the most scientific meal of the day."
msgstr "El desayuno es la comida más científica del día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "What rotten luck."
msgstr "Qué mala suerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER"
msgid "Can you use the celery as a straw?"
msgstr "¿Se puede usar el apio de pajita?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "I think my grandmother wore something similar."
msgstr "Creo que mi abuela solía ponerse algo parecido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Those shadows are all cut from the same cloth."
msgstr "Esas sombras están cortadas por el mismo patrón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT"
msgid "It makes me feel dark and mysterious."
msgstr "Me hace sentir oscuro y misterioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG"
msgid "What's the return policy?"
msgstr "¿Y la política de devoluciones?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT"
msgid "My knowledge of sewing with shadows is patchy at best."
msgstr "Mi conocimiento sobre costura con sombras es muy poco uniforme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE"
msgid "It makes harvesting so easy, it's scary!"
msgstr "¡Hace que cosechar sea tan fácil que da miedo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA"
msgid "I always hate when my hair gets melted by acid."
msgstr "Odio que el ácido me derrita el pelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY"
msgid "It's shockingly delicious."
msgstr "Es sorprendentemente delicioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "I'm waffling on whether it needs more syrup."
msgstr "¿Necesitará más sirope el gofre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "Fascinating!"
msgstr "¡Fascinante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE"
msgid "Keeping it under wraps for now."
msgstr "No vamos a desvelar nada por ahora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT"
msgid "Big automatons really do come in small packages."
msgstr "Los grandes autómatas vienen en paquetes pequeños."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS"
msgid "It comes in pieces!"
msgstr "¡Viene por partes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG"
msgid "It withstood for a while!"
msgstr "¡Ha aguantado bastante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED"
msgid "Has anyone tried resetting it?"
msgstr "¿Alguien ha probado a resetearlo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET"
msgid "How intriguing!"
msgstr "¡Qué emoción!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON"
msgid "This will help keep things contained."
msgstr "Esto ayudará a contener las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED"
msgid "It's too damaged to fix but I can salvage the parts."
msgstr "Está demasiado dañado, pero puedo aprovechar las piezas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC"
msgid "Like a bot out of hell."
msgstr "Como salido del mismísimo infierno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE"
msgid "We should take it for a whirl."
msgstr "Deberíamos llevarlo a dar una vuelta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS"
msgid "Now I can put a positive spin on things."
msgstr "Ya puedo empezar a darle vueltas a las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED"
msgid "I could repair it or harvest for parts."
msgstr "Podría repararlo o aprovechar las piezas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY"
msgid "Spin it to win it!"
msgstr "¡Gira para ganar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC"
msgid "They just drone on and on."
msgstr "No paran, no paran."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE"
msgid "We should take it for a whirl."
msgstr "Deberíamos llevarlo a dar una vuelta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT"
msgid "Machines that fix other machines! What will science think of next?"
msgstr "¡Máquinas que arreglan otras máquinas! ¿Qué será lo siguiente que hará la ciencia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT"
msgid "It really gets my gears turning."
msgstr "Creo que no me falta ningún tornillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS"
msgid "I bet I could make something incredibly scientific with this."
msgstr "Seguro que podría hacer algo muy científico con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL"
msgid "Wall or nothing!"
msgstr "¡Muro o nada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT"
msgid "What is this floor?"
msgstr "¿Qué es este suelo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER"
msgid "It's a good time to switch things up."
msgstr "Nunca es mal momento para tirar de la palanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION"
msgid "Let's get to work!"
msgstr "¡Al tajo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1"
msgid "Strange, this glove is not a projection."
msgstr "Qué raro, este guante no es una proyección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2"
msgid "This clipboard is... real."
msgstr "Este sujetapapeles es... real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY"
msgid "There might be some discoveries to be made in this pile of junk."
msgstr "En este montón de chatarra podría haber algo por descubrir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE"
msgid "Fascinating! Illuminating! Brain-embiggening!"
msgstr "¡Fascinante! ¡Brillante! ¡Inteligentizante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC"
msgid "As a fellow man of science, I'm compelled to help him!"
msgstr "¡Me veo en la obligación de ayudar a mis compañeros científicos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS"
msgid "Science never rests!"
msgstr "¡La ciencia nunca duerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK"
msgid "I wonder where he's off to..."
msgstr "Me pregunto a dónde irá..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1"
msgid "That has to be the tool I'm looking for!"
msgstr "Seguro que esta es la herramienta que estaba buscando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2"
msgid "Of course I know what it is! It's just, er... too complicated to explain."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto que sé lo que es! Es, eh... Um... Es un poco complicado de explicar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3"
msgid "Clearly a very scientific tool!"
msgstr "Se ve a la legua que es una herramienta científica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4"
msgid "My scientific instincts tell me that this is the tool I'm looking for!"
msgstr "Mi instinto de científico me dice que esta es la herramienta que busco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5"
msgid "I know exactly what it does! Science!"
msgstr "¡Sé perfectamente lo que hace! ¡Ciencia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "Couldn't we have just made a lifeboat?"
msgstr "¿No podríamos haber hecho un bote salvavidas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT"
msgid "Couldn't we have just made a lifeboat?"
msgstr "¿No podríamos haber hecho un bote salvavidas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS"
msgid "Couldn't we have just made a lifeboat?"
msgstr "¿No podríamos haber hecho un bote salvavidas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD"
msgid "Dressing it up doesn't make me feel better about using it."
msgstr "Engalanarlo no hace que me sienta mejor al usarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK"
