#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL"
msgid "Got it! What is it?"
