#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "It's showing me strange designs... I don't think I've seen them before."
msgstr "Me está mostrando unos diseños rarísimos... Creo que no los había visto antes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER"
msgid "This place is like a clock that's been left unwound."
msgstr "Este lugar es como un reloj al que no le han dado cuerda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE"
msgid "I know this. Or maybe I will know it soon."
msgstr "Esto ya me lo sé. O lo sabré pronto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "Time to move!"
msgstr "¡Hora de partir!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "I need to get out of here!"
msgstr "¡Necesito salir de aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATRIUM_DESTABILIZING.3"
msgid "Something's happening... I can't stay here!"
msgstr "Está pasando algo raro... ¡No puedo quedarme aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "I want to punch something!!"
msgstr "¡Qué ganas de pegarle un puñetazo a alguien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "I've never felt so full of energy!"
msgstr "¡Nunca me había sentido con tanta energía!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "I feel thoroughly waterproofed."
msgstr "Me siento bastante impermeable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "I feel a bit safer, strangely."
msgstr "Es raro, pero me siento algo más segura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "Finally, I don't have to waste time sleeping!"
msgstr "¡Por fin! Ya no tengo que perder el tiempo durmiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "This is more like it! I'll have everything done in no time at all!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto! Así lo tendré todo listo en un momentito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST"
msgid "oOooOooo!!"
msgstr "¡¡oOooOooo!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BEES"
msgid "Oh botheration. Those bees really tick me off!"
msgstr "Qué fastidio... Cómo me cabrean esas abejas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "Oh no no no! T-the boat's taking on water!!"
msgstr "¡¡¡Oh, no!!! ¡E-el barco se está llenando de agua!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK"
msgid "No, wait! I need more time!!"
msgstr "¡Un momento! ¡Necesito más tiempo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG"
msgid "What goes around comes around."
msgstr "Lo que se va siempre vuelve."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION"
msgid "It doesn't seem quite as scary this time around."
msgstr "Esta vez no parece dar tanto miedo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_BURNT"
msgid "I was almost burnt to a crisp!"
msgstr "¡Casi me quemo viva!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF"
msgid "Over here!"
msgstr "¡Ven aquí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX"
msgid "\nI've repaired complicated timepieces, fixing this should be easy!"
msgstr "\nHe reparado relojes complicadísimos, así que esto será moco de pavo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS"
msgid "Oh botheration, I'll have to pick up a few things first."
msgstr "Qué fastidio, voy a tener que recoger algunas cosillas antes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION"
msgid "I won't be able to make it without a proper workstation."
msgstr "No voy a poder hacer nada sin un buen sitio para trabajar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH"
msgid "I haven't quite figured that one out yet."
msgstr "Todavía no tengo muy claro cómo se hace."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST"
msgid "It'd be more efficient to put it closer to the judge's booth."
msgstr "Sería mejor que estuviera cerca del puesto del juez."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE"
msgid "Why can't I seem to...? Oh no..."
msgstr "¿Por qué no puedo...? Oh, no..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP"
msgid "There's no time for sleeping!"
msgstr "¡No hay tiempo para ponerse a dormir!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED"
msgid "This is no time to stand around!"
msgstr "¡No es momento para quedarse de patitas cruzadas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING"
msgid "How did I end up with such a slow carrat?"
msgstr "¿Cómo he acabado con una zanarrata tan lenta?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.1"
msgid "Oh no... my bad sense of direction must've rubbed off on it."
msgstr "Ay, no... Creo que se le ha pegado mi falta de orientación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WRONG_WAY.2"
msgid "Wrong way, go back!"
msgstr "No es por ahí, ¡vuelve!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE"
msgid "On my mark, three, one, two-- GO!"
msgstr "A mi señal. Tres, uno, dos... ¡YA!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN"
msgid "No no no! Everything's falling apart!"
msgstr "¡No, no, no! ¡Se está derrumbando todo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE"
msgid "This is fine."
msgstr "Está bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHARGE"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE"
msgid "They found me... N-no! Stay away!"
msgstr "Me ha encontrado... ¡N-no! ¡Largo!"

