#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Hold on a tick, is my hair falling out?!"
msgstr "Un segundo... ¿¡Se me está cayendo el pelo!?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "You stay away from me!"
msgstr "¡No te acerques a mí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "What a nasty little thing!"
msgstr "¡Qué cosa tan desagradable!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "The attention to detail is incredible!"
msgstr "Es impresionante la de atención a los detalles que tiene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Something's nagging at the back of my brain... I'm sure it's nothing."
msgstr "Creo que me olvido de un pequeño detalle... Bueno, seguro que no era nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Just pop it in your mouth, it's good for you!"
msgstr "Directo a la boca, que es bueno para la salud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Mmm, so fragrant!"
msgstr "Mmm, qué bien huele."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It's still hard to believe garlic could grow so big."
msgstr "Me cuesta creer que los ajos puedan crecer tanto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Why waste time growing them when I can just eat them now?"
msgstr "¿Para qué perder el tiempo plantándolas si me las puedo comer ya?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "It might help me stave off this terrible heat."
msgstr "A lo mejor me sirve para soportar este terrible calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "They're too big for pocket watches, unfortunately."
msgstr "Es una pena, pero son muy grandes para los relojes de bolsillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't let it slow me down."
msgstr "No puedo permitir que me retrase."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "Oh, no..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "What's that inside?"
msgstr "¿Qué es eso que hay dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "What should we do with this?"
msgstr "¿Qué deberíamos hacer con esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "Suspended in time."
msgstr "Suspendido en el tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "It'll extend the expiration date."
msgstr "Retrasará la fecha de caducidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "Best get to it then."
msgstr "Pues manos a la obra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "It needs THREE gems to work?!"
msgstr "¿¡Necesita TRES gemas para ponerse en marcha!?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "This thing sure takes up a lot of space."
msgstr "Este trasto ocupa mucho espacio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "One less potential reanimated corpse to worry about."
msgstr "Un cadáver reanimado menos del que preocuparse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd better burn that thing before it's too late."
msgstr "Será mejor que queme esa cosa antes de que sea demasiado tarde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "I was afraid of this."
msgstr "Me lo temía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "Would making a deal with another mysterious entity be pushing my luck?"
msgstr "¿Sería tentar a la suerte si intento hacer un trato con otra entidad misteriosa?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "Hello there."
msgstr "Buenas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Empty."
msgstr "Está vacía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "They're not too interested in talking."
msgstr "No tienen mucho interés en hablar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "They know what we've done."
msgstr "Saben lo que hemos hecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "Stay away from me! I won't become like you!"
msgstr "¡Aléjate de mí! ¡No pienso ser como tú!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "It's little more than a memory."
msgstr "No es más que un recuerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "Who has time to pick flowers?"
msgstr "¿Quién tiene tiempo para coger flores?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "Un poquito de metafísica nunca le ha hecho daño a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "Un poquito de metafísica nunca le ha hecho daño a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "Un poquito de metafísica nunca le ha hecho daño a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "A little bit of metaphysical meddling never hurt anyone."
msgstr "¿A quién le ha hecho daño alguna vez un poco de metafísica?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Oh! Uh... was I supposed to bring a present too?"
msgstr "¡Oh! Eh... ¿Tenía que traer un regalo yo también?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Wouldn't it be quicker to just put it in a nice bag?"
msgstr "¿No tardaría menos si lo metiera en una bolsita mona?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "It's so tastefully decorated!"
msgstr "¡Está decorada con muy buen gusto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Oh, these are the ones that run!"
msgstr "Anda, estos son los que corren."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "I think I've lost my appetite..."
msgstr "Creo que he perdido el apetito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "Nothing is permanent, eventually it might be sand again."
msgstr "Nada es eterno y, con el tiempo, todo puede volver a convertirse en polvo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "I'm impressed the glass doesn't shatter on impact."
msgstr "Me sorprende que el vidrio no se rompa con los golpes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "It looks nice now that it's not trying to impale me."
msgstr "Es bonita... ahora que no está intentando empalarme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Who's a cute little bug thing? You are!"
msgstr "¿Quién es un bichito bonito? ¡Sí, tú!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleeping again?"
msgstr "¿Ya estás durmiendo otra vez?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "Why must life be so fleeting for some?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la vida es tan efímera para algunos...?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "I like anything that can make its own light."
msgstr "Me gustan las cosas que irradian luz propia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Oh. Droppings. How lovely."
msgstr "Oh. Excrementos. Qué alegría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "I'm just not going to think about where they came from!"
msgstr "Prefiero ignorar el lugar del que proceden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "What a delightfully useful dessert!"
msgstr "¡Qué postre tan útil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "I'll bet you feel pretty foolish now, don't you?"
msgstr "Seguro que ahora te sientes un poco tonto, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "I'm starting to feel a bit bad about taking its horn."
msgstr "Me empiezo a sentir mal por quitarle el cuerno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Alright you can come along, just don't slow me down."
msgstr "Vale, puedes venir, pero no hagas que me retrase."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Another obviously made-up creature."
msgstr "Otra criatura inventada. Si es que es evidente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Who ever heard of a whale with a horn?"
msgstr "¿Quién ha oído hablar de las ballenas con cuerno?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "The flavor is indescribable."
msgstr "Tiene un sabor indescriptible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I think they go nicely with what I'm wearing."
msgstr "Creo que quedan bien con la ropa que llevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "What else will I use gold for around here?"
msgstr "¿Para qué más voy a usar el oro aquí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "Just don't think about it and it'll make sense."
msgstr "Si no lo piensas mucho, seguro que tiene sentido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "I wouldn't want that gold to go to waste."
msgstr "No querría que se desperdiciara ese oro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "If I have to spend time digging holes, I can at least be fancy."
msgstr "Si tengo que perder el tiempo cavando, al menos estaré elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "Why can't the dirt just move itself?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no puede ararse sola la tierra?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Hmm... would a solid gold pocket watch be too much?"
msgstr "Um... No sé si un reloj de bolsillo de oro sería muy estrafalario."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "I'm sure I'll find a use for it sooner or later."
msgstr "Seguro que le acabo encontrando alguna utilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "I could probably find something to help speed up its growth."
msgstr "Seguro que puedo encontrar algo para que crezca más rápido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr "Ay, qué mal..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "Parece bastante enfermo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "Eh, algo va mal aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Grass. You do tend to find a lot of it outside."
msgstr "Hierba. Suele abundar en el exterior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "And now it'll begin the painfully slow process of growing back."
msgstr "Y ahora comienza el tedioso proceso de volver a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "Nothing will grow in this heat."
msgstr "No va a crecer nada con este calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "It seems to want nothing to do with us, which is fine by me."
msgstr "No quiere saber nada de nosotros y, sinceramente, me parece bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks really sick."
msgstr "Parece bastante enfermo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "Jumpy little things, aren't they? That's probably wise."
msgstr "Ay, cómo saltan, ¿eh? Seguro que es por algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "Quite the afternoonified rain napper, isn't it?"
msgstr "Qué protector de lluvia tan coqueto, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Empty."
msgstr "Está vacía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "I hope this is temporary."
msgstr "Espero que esto solo sea temporal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "I don't need any turkey to pour it over, just hand me a spoon."
msgstr "No necesito echársela a ninguna comida, dame una cuchara."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "Beautifully efficient."
msgstr "Eficaz y precioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "If only I could've gotten my hands on one of these before... well never mind."
msgstr "Si hubiera podido conseguir una de estas antes... Bueno, da igual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "It'll help me keep track of where I've been."
msgstr "Me servirá para saber dónde he estado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It's cruder than my pocket watch, but it follows the same basic principles."
msgstr "Es más tosco que mi reloj de bolsillo, pero tiene los mismos principios básicos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Ugh, mushrooms..."
msgstr "Puaj, hongos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "For some reason the thought of eating it isn't so repulsive now."
msgstr "No sé por qué, pero ya no me repugna tanto la idea de comérmelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a green mushroom."
msgstr "Es un hongo verde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It's probably just some kind of mushroom."
msgstr "Supongo que es una especie de hongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "No sense waiting around for it to grow back."
msgstr "No tiene sentido quedarme a esperar a que crezca de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "It's not a pool I'd care to take a dip in."
msgstr "No me gustaría nada bañarme ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "It's not a pool I'd care to take a dip in."
msgstr "No me gustaría nada bañarme ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "Guacamole, guac-guac-amole!"
msgstr "¡Guacamole, guacamoooole!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Bat droppings. Lovely."
msgstr "Excrementos de murciélago. Qué alegría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "There's an infinite number of ways this could go very badly."
msgstr "Esto podría salir mal de tantas formas que ni puedo contarlas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "An apple improved by a delicious candy coating."
msgstr "Una manzana mejorada con una cobertura de caramelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "Something sweet that never goes bad, what's not to love?"
msgstr "Algo dulce que nunca se pasa, es la perfección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "Oh alright, I'll take a nibble."
msgstr "Bueno, va, le daré un mordisquito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "If nobody else wants them I'll happily take them."
msgstr "Si no los quiere nadie, ya me los quedo yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "That seems like a self-fulfilling prophecy."
msgstr "Esto es como una profecía que se cumple sola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Sweet mixed with spicy!"
msgstr "¡Es dulce y picante a la vez!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Delicious candied corn to munch on."
msgstr "Maíz caramelizado para comer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Who is trying to pass this ordinary corn cob off as candy?"
msgstr "¿Quién quiere colar esta mazorca normal y corriente como si fuera un dulce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "That'll be something to chew on for a while."
msgstr "Me tendrá un rato masticando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "I'll stash some extras in my pocket, I'm sure the children would love some hard candy."
msgstr "Me guardaré más en el bolsillo. Seguro que los niños quieren caramelos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "Do you think I was born yesterday?"
msgstr "¿Te crees que nací ayer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "A little extra fiber never hurt anyone."
msgstr "Un poco más de fibra no le hace daño a nadie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "This little ghost I like."
msgstr "Este fantasma chiquitito sí que me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "Chewy, and only a little wormy."
msgstr "Gomoso y con un toque agusanado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Fear keeps you safe, but bravery keeps you going."
msgstr "El miedo te mantiene a salvo, pero la valentía te hace seguir adelante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "I can feel the potential radiating out of it."
msgstr "Siento el potencial que irradia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "I'm a clocksmith, not a chemist."
msgstr "Soy relojera, no química."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "This might have been a frivolous use of my time..."
msgstr "Creo que he desperdiciado el tiempo fútilmente..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "It smells like shifting possibilities."
msgstr "Huele a miles de posibilidades."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "What a gloomy way to celebrate."
msgstr "Qué forma tan lúgubre de celebrar nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "I guess I could spend a little time decorating."
msgstr "Supongo que puedo pasarme un rato decorando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "Ugh, I don't want to be reminded of them."
msgstr "Uf, no quiero acordarme de ellos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "I might as well put it up somewhere."
msgstr "Voy a colgarlo en algún lado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "It's meant to be displayed on a tree, if I recall."
msgstr "Si no recuerdo mal, se tiene que colgar en un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "There's so many real ones flying about, it seems a bit redundant."
msgstr "Con todos los que hay volando por ahí, me parece un poco redundante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "Well, the pig had it coming."
msgstr "Bueno, el cerdo se lo merecía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "Sometimes things need undoing."
msgstr "A veces hay que destruir las cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "It's a heavy hammer for hitting things."
msgstr "Un martillo pesado para golpear cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "It looks quite comfortable."
msgstr "Parece bastante cómoda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Who thought this was a good idea?"
msgstr "¿Quién pensó que era una buena idea?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "What a lovely fragrance!"
msgstr "¡Qué olorcillo tan agradable!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "It's horribly scratchy."
msgstr "Es demasiado áspera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "Disgusting!"
msgstr "¡Qué asco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "It might be nice to kick back and unwind... for a minute or two."
msgstr "Estaría bien relajarse y desconectar..., aunque fuera un par de minutos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "That won't help, what I need is time!"
msgstr "Eso no servirá, ¡lo que necesito es tiempo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "This wretched concoction might buy us a little time."
msgstr "Este horrible mejunje podría darnos algo de tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE"
msgid "A quick application couldn't hurt."
msgstr "Creo que debería ponerme un poquito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "It conducts regenerative energy."
msgstr "Conduce energía regenerativa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's cool to the touch."
msgstr "Está fría al tacto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "It's ice cold."
msgstr "Está congelada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "This isn't an ordinary rock."
msgstr "Esta roca no es muy común..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "I almost singed my fingers!"
msgstr "¡Casi me chamusco los dedos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "Something to warm up these old bones."
msgstr "Hace que entren en calor estos huesos viejos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Fool me once, shame on you. Fool me twice, shame on you again!"
msgstr "Si me engañas una vez, la culpa es tuya. Si me engañas dos veces, ¡culpa seguirá siendo tuya!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Was that rosebush there a second ago?"
msgstr "¿Ese rosal estaba ahí antes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "Ha! She's just as crabby as ever."
msgstr "¡Ja! Está tan gruñona como siempre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "It'll keep the chill out of my bones."
msgstr "Me quitará el frío de los huesos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "Only good if I remember to take it beforehand."
msgstr "Solo vale si me acuerdo de tomármelo antes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "A sure way to gather my wits."
msgstr "Una buena forma de mantener la compostura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "The moon imparts an unforgettable taste."
msgstr "La luna le da un sabor inolvidable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "A charming cup of tea to keep the insanity away."
msgstr "Una buena taza de té para mantener la cabeza fría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "I'm sure there's a good use for it."
msgstr "Seguro que tiene alguna utilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "Hm. For a quick cool down."
msgstr "Mmm. Para reducir la temperatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "A nice little pick-me-up."
msgstr "Un ben reconstituyente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "Oh botheration, what a mess."
msgstr "Oh, qué fastidio. Menudo desastre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "What a cheery sight."
msgstr "Qué acogedor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "I think she'll be rather pleased with this."
msgstr "Creo que le gustará."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Where did I move her to again?"
msgstr "¿A dónde la he mandado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "How long has it been since I last paid Pearl a visit?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo fue la última vez que fui a ver a Perla?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "It is time for tea."
msgstr "Es la hora del té."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "One must take their time brewing tea."
msgstr "Preparar un buen té lleva su tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "A shame. I should have seen it coming."
msgstr "Es una pena. Tendría que haberlo visto venir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope Pearl is in soon."
msgstr "Espero que Perla no tarde mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "There's a time to slow down and enjoy the little things."
msgstr "A veces hay que pararse a disfrutar de las pequeñas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "No sense standing around an empty hole."
msgstr "¿Qué sentido tiene quedarse junto a un agujero vacío?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks so warm and inviting."
msgstr "Tiene pinta de estar tan calentito que dan ganas de entrar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "Of course it's not done."
msgstr "Está sin terminar, cómo no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "Time well spent."
msgstr "Qué tiempo tan bien empleado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It was a fine home once, but it's fallen into disrepair."
msgstr "En su día fue un hogar estupendo, pero ha caído en el abandono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "When's the last time I did laundry?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo fue la última vez que hice la colada?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Rather charming."
msgstr "Encantador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "Ooooh I wonder what fun knickknacks are inside!"
msgstr "Oh... ¿Qué clase de baratijas tendrá dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "A nice assortment of shells to add to my little collection."
msgstr "Una gran selección de conchas para mi pequeña colección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "I was holding out hope things would go differently this time."
msgstr "Tenía la esperanza de que las cosas fueran de otra forma esta vez..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "I'll... do my best."
msgstr "Haré... todo lo que pueda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "How delightfully strange!"
msgstr "¡Qué cosa tan curiosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "I've stumbled into someone's home."
msgstr "Me he encontrado con la casa de alguien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "That's a bad sign."
msgstr "Eso es una mala señal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "That must be some kind of sign."
msgstr "Supongo que es algún tipo de señal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "There's nothing written here. What an unhelpful sign!"
msgstr "Aquí no hay nada escrito. Qué señal más inútil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "A little something to satisfy my sweet tooth."
msgstr "Un caprichito para satisfacer mis ganas de dulce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "It's much better once you pick out the bees."
msgstr "Está mucho mejor al quitar las abejas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "You can't go wrong dousing something in honey."
msgstr "Las cosas con un poco de miel siempre saben bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "The dipping sauce is my favorite part."
msgstr "Lo que más me gusta es la salsa para mojar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "It belonged to a beefalo in the past."
msgstr "Antes le pertenecía a un beefalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "It gives me a terrible feeling..."
msgstr "Me da muy mal rollo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "A little luck never hurt."
msgstr "Un poco de suerte nunca está de más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Hoooo... I always forget just how spicy it is."
msgstr "Aaaah... Siempre me olvido de lo mucho que pican."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "There's no sense in questioning these things."
msgstr "No tiene sentido cuestionarse estas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "No sense standing around an empty hole."
msgstr "¿Qué sentido tiene quedarse junto a un agujero vacío?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks so warm and inviting."
msgstr "Tiene pinta de estar tan calentito que dan ganas de entrar..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "A giant splash, frozen in time."
msgstr "Un gran chapuzón congelado en el tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "Stay away! I refuse to be eaten by the likes of you!"
msgstr "¡Aparta! ¡Me niego a que me coma un bicho como tú!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "Old bones. Let's not dwell on them."
msgstr "Huesos viejos. Será mejor no pensar mucho en ello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "It was the only way."
msgstr "No había otra manera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh! I don't want to look at it!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! No quiero ni mirarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "I don't like it when THEY do it."
msgstr "No me gusta que lo hagan ELLOS."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Ugh, a dwelling made of old bones!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! Una guarida hecha de huesos viejos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "I could have been eaten!"
msgstr "¡Se me podrían haber comido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "A toothy take on a timeless design."
msgstr "Una versión dentada de un diseño atemporal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "It might be useful if I ever need to train some unruly dogs."
msgstr "Podría serme útil si tengo que entrenar a algún perro desobediente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "You come with your own lamp? I'm impressed!"
msgstr "Anda, ¿vienes con una luz incluida? ¡Anonadada me hallo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Who would leave a fishbowl in a cave? I hope it wasn't me..."
msgstr "¿Quién dejaría una pecera en una cueva? Espero no haber sido yo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "I think his time might've run out..."
msgstr "Creo que le ha llegado la hora..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "A frozen chunk of future water."
msgstr "Un trozo de futura agua congelada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's steer clear of that."
msgstr "Mejor no acercarse a eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It's completely melted."
msgstr "Se ha derretido por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It's completely melted."
msgstr "Se ha derretido por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "I'm all for making things last longer."
msgstr "Adoro hacer que las cosas duren más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Alright, maybe just a bowl or two."
msgstr "Bueno, a lo mejor un bol o dos..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Simple and effective."
msgstr "Simple y eficaz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "What did I ever do to you?!"
msgstr "¿¡Qué te he hecho yo!?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "It'll give my food a longer lifespan."
msgstr "Con esto aguantará más mi comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "It'll freeze anything in its tracks."
msgstr "Lo congelará todo a su paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "I could dabble in some ice magic."
msgstr "Podría darle un poco a la magia de hielo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "I'll need a hot cup of tea after this."
msgstr "Voy a necesitar una buena taza de té calentito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "The poor beefalo's going to catch a chill wearing that!"
msgstr "El pobre beefalo va a pillar un resfriado si se pone eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "This stinks of shadow magic shenanigans."
msgstr "Esto apesta a magia sombría..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "That looks awfully suspect."
msgstr "Es sospechoso hasta decir basta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "It seems to be locked onto a very particular temporal wavelength."
msgstr "Parece que están fijas en una longitud de onda temporal muy concreta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "Ha! Still kicking!"
msgstr "¡Ja! ¡Sigo vivita y coleando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "I'm not going to be fooled into tasting that, thank you very much!"
msgstr "¡No me engañarás para que me coma eso, muchas gracias!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "Oh botheration, now I'll have to clean all of this up!"
msgstr "Qué fastidio, ahora tengo que recoger todo esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "A jar! That's what I forgot!"
msgstr "¡Un tarro! Eso es lo que me he olvidado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "I like to keep a bit of candy in my pocket at all times."
msgstr "Me gusta llevar siempre algún caramelo encima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "There might be something worth my time in there."
msgstr "Seguro que hay algo que valga la pena el tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT"
msgid "I remember seeing something up there."
msgstr "Recuerdo haber visto algo ahí arriba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not eager to be crushed by a teetering pile of scrap metal."
msgstr "No me apetece que me aplaste un montón tambaleante de chatarra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "Just how I like my eggs, quick and easy."
msgstr "Justo como a mí me gustan: rápidos y sencillos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "No need for a plate or utensils, just grab it and go!"
msgstr "No hacen falta ni platos ni cubiertos, ¡se come tal cual!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "It tastes about as good as it looks."
msgstr "Está tan bueno como parece."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "It's not the craziest thing I've worn."
msgstr "No es la cosa más rara que me he probado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "I don't know why I wasted time cooking it."
msgstr "No sé para qué he perdido el tiempo cocinándola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "I don't know if it was worth the wait."
msgstr "No sé si ha merecido la espera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "I won't be killed by the likes of you, bee!"
msgstr "¡No me matará un bicho como tú, abeja!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "I'm not quite sure what my plan is here."
msgstr "No tengo muy claro qué planeo hacer con esto..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Playtime is over."
msgstr "Se ha acabado la hora del recreo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't have time to watch these kits play all day."
msgstr "No tengo tiempo para pasarme todo el día mirando como juegan las crías."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Do I really have time to fuss with this?"
msgstr "¿De verdad tengo tiempo para esto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "No more playing, for the time being."
msgstr "Se acabó el juego, al menos por ahora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't keep getting distracted by those adorable antics!"
msgstr "¡No puedo permitir que estas cositas tan adorables sigan distrayéndome!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Surely someone with more time on their hands could set it up."
msgstr "Seguro que alguien con más tiempo libre podría montarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that's that."
msgstr "Bien, se acabó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "What a charming little house."
msgstr "Que casita tan encantadora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "Did I find them all? I think there are some still hiding."
msgstr "¿Los he encontrado a todos? Creo que aún quedan algunos escondidos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "Ugh, where are they? I'm running out of time!"
msgstr "Ugh, ¿dónde se han metido? ¡Se me acaba el tiempo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "Did I not set that up already?"
msgstr "¿Eso no lo había preparado ya?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Oh how adorable, and conveniently pocket-sized!"
msgstr "Oh, qué monada. ¡Y es de bolsillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "Botheration, they're so distractingly cute!"
msgstr "¡Qué fastidio, es tan mono que no para de distraerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "Oh how adorable, and conveniently pocket-sized!"
msgstr "Oh, qué monada. ¡Y es de bolsillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "Botheration, they're so distractingly cute!"
msgstr "¡Qué fastidio, es tan mono que no para de distraerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "Oh how adorable, and conveniently pocket-sized!"
msgstr "Oh, qué monada. ¡Y es de bolsillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "Botheration, they're so distractingly cute!"
msgstr "¡Qué fastidio, es tan mono que no para de distraerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "This will make it easier to remember who's who at least."
msgstr "Al menos así será más fácil saber quién es quién."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "Botheration, they're so distractingly cute!"
msgstr "¡Qué fastidio, es tan mono que no para de distraerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "Oh how adorable, and conveniently pocket-sized!"
msgstr "Oh, qué monada. ¡Y es de bolsillo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "Botheration, they're so distractingly cute!"
msgstr "¡Qué fastidio, es tan mono que no para de distraerme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "Is it that time of year again already?"
msgstr "¿Ya estamos en esa época del año otra vez?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "This looks like just the piece I need."
msgstr "Parece la pieza que necesito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "At least he left some goodies!"
msgstr "¡Al menos se ha dejado alguna cosita!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "Clockwork and I usually get along just fine..."
msgstr "Los mecanismos y yo solemos llevarnos bien..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "I... I don't want to look at it."
msgstr "No... No quiero ni mirar..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "A loyal horse."
msgstr "Un caballo muy leal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "Who do you serve?"
msgstr "¿A quién sirves?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "What happened to chivalry?"
msgstr "¿Es que ya no queda ningún caballero?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "Its time has ended."
msgstr "Su tiempo se ha acabado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "It's in the spring of its life."
msgstr "Está en la flor de la vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "It's grown a warm winter coat."
msgstr "Le ha salido un pelaje de invierno muy calentito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "It looks very filling."
msgstr "Con lo llena que está seguro que llena mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "He really puts a damper on this time of year."
msgstr "Sí que se amarga en esta época del año."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "For me? You shouldn't have!"
msgstr "¿Para mí? Ay, no hacía falta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "I'd better keep this close, just in case."
msgstr "Será mejor tenerlo cerca por si acaso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "Delicious discs of crisp potatoes."
msgstr "Rodajas de patata crujientes y deliciosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "This armor has been petrified for maximum protection."
msgstr "Esta armadura ha sido petrificada para proporcionar máxima protección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "That's as good as it gets."
msgstr "Es lo mejor que hay."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Light, but not very durable."
msgstr "Ligera, pero no muy duradera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "Lightweight and designed for mobility."
msgstr "Ligera y diseñada para la movilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "It offers a decent amount of protection."
msgstr "Ofrece una cantidad decente de protección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "That could help me hit a little harder."
msgstr "Podría ayudarme a golpear un poco más fuerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "I'd have energy for a few more stunts wearing that."
msgstr "Si me la pongo tendría energía para unas cuantas acrobacias más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "That should keep me safe."
msgstr "Debería protegerme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "Everyone, break the Battle Standard!"
msgstr "¡Romped el estandarte de batalla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "He might make a good distraction for us."
msgstr "Podría ser una buena distracción para nosotros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "That's the guy in charge here."
msgstr "Ese es el tipo que manda aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "That could cause some major destruction."
msgstr "Podría causar una destrucción importante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "It's a rock monster!"
msgstr "¡Un monstruo de piedra!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "It has a gaze full of science."
msgstr "Tiene una mirada llena de ciencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "Those fluffy feathers make me want to run!"
msgstr "¡Esas plumas suaves me incitan a correr!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "It smells like brimstone."
msgstr "Huele a azufre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "The blossom interacts well with healing magic."
msgstr "La flor interactúa bien con la magia curativa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "This garland will restore a bit of my vitality."
msgstr "Esta guirnalda restaurará un poco mi vitalidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "A sharp looking instrument."
msgstr "Un instrumento afilado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "It needs a key."
msgstr "Necesita una llave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "That should do it."
msgstr "Eso valdrá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "My strikes would hurt a little more wearing that."
msgstr "Si lo llevo mis golpes harían un poco más de daño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "That weapon's for throwing."
msgstr "Esa arma es para lanzarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's how we got here. Hopefully how we get back, too."
msgstr "Así es como llegamos aquí. Espero que así sea también como regresemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "I'll just be going now."
msgstr "Me iré ahora mismo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "Those crystals will quicken my abilities."
msgstr "Esos cristales acelerarán mis habilidades."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "This is where those enemies are coming from."
msgstr "De aquí salen esos enemigos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "It looks like it packs a wallop."
msgstr "Parece que hace mucha pupa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "Looks like it amplifies healing expertise."
msgstr "Parece que amplifica la curación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "Tsk, she just lets her children run wild!"
msgstr "Buf, ¡si es que deja que se desmadren sus crías!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "Is it... dead?"
msgstr "¿Está... muerta?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's warm, I think this egg has already been cooked."
msgstr "Está caliente. Creo que este huevo ya está hecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "It's cooling off, I don't think that's good."
msgstr "Se está enfriando y dudo que eso sea bueno..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "I can almost imagine it smiling."
msgstr "Casi me la imagino sonriendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "She looks about as happy as a bug covered in lava can look."
msgstr "Está tan feliz como podría estarlo un bicho cubierto de lava."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "She seems to like me for some reason."
msgstr "Creo que le caigo bien, pero no sé por qué."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "Is it feeding time again already?"
msgstr "¿Otra vez es hora de comer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "Oh botheration, did I forget to feed you again?"
msgstr "Qué fastidio. ¿Me he vuelto a olvidar de darte de comer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "Well this feels vaguely threatening."
msgstr "Parece un poco amenazador, pero no mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "I think it's safe to touch. But why would I want to?"
msgstr "Creo que no es peligroso tocarla, pero ¿por qué querría hacerlo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Hot!!"
msgstr "¡¡Quema!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "Not for swimming."
msgstr "Ahí no se puede nadar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "You've seen one rock, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Con ver una roca, ya las has visto todas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "The loaf has been set very fashionably in jelly."
msgstr "Pastel de carne dentro de una gelatina colocado con muy buen gusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "It has a very interesting texture."
msgstr "Tiene una textura muy interesante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "This flummery has an odd taste to it."
msgstr "Esta ensalada tiene un sabor un poco extraño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "Even the trees are out to get me!"
msgstr "¡Hasta los árboles vienen a por mí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "What a funny little trinket!"
msgstr "¡Qué cosa tan curiosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Even the trees are out to get me!"
msgstr "¡Hasta los árboles vienen a por mí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "I'm not stopping to gawk at every plant I see!"
msgstr "¡No pienso pararme a mirar todas las plantas que veo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "I have no use for it, what I need is more time!"
msgstr "No me sirve de nada, ¡si yo necesito tiempo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "It will give me a few precious minutes of light."
msgstr "Me dará unos minutos de luz valiosísimos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "I'm thankful for any speck of light around here."
msgstr "Aquí fuera se agradece cualquier fuente de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Oh the havoc you've wreaked across timelines..."
msgstr "Menudo caos has provocado entre las líneas temporales..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "I feel a bit reassured knowing it's nearby."
msgstr "Me siento más segura sabiendo que está cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "What happened to you? You look a mess!"
msgstr "¿Qué te ha pasado? ¡Estás fatal!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Come here you old goat!"
msgstr "¡Ven aquí, cabra vieja!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "Twisty, like time itself."
msgstr "Es sinuoso, igual que el flujo del tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Yep, the lightning rod was a good idea."
msgstr "Sí, lo del pararrayos fue buena idea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Just in case the sky starts getting any funny ideas."
msgstr "Esto es por si el cielo planea algo raro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "Ah, youth. Enjoy it while you can."
msgstr "Ay, la juventud... Disfrutad mientras podáis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "This log is a lot livelier than it should be."
msgstr "Este tronco está más vivo de lo que debería."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Oh, what a horrible face it has!"
msgstr "¡Qué cara tan horrible tiene!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "The root inside is particularly lively."
msgstr "La raíz del interior tiene muchísima vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "That's starting to look unpleasant."
msgstr "Empieza a parecerme desagradable..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "Would it be a frivolous use of time travel to go back and eat it over and over again?"
msgstr "¿Sería muy frívolo viajar en el tiempo para volver a comérmela una y otra vez?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "Mmmm, hot buttered wobster!"
msgstr "Mmmm... ¡Langüosta con mantequilla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "That seems like a good use for a log."
msgstr "A ese tronco se le ha dado un buen uso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It came from a tree, as you'd expect."
msgstr "Proviene de un árbol, obviamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "I have no patience for all your pestering!"
msgstr "¡No tengo paciencia para tantas molestias!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "Qué fastidio, creo que tengo alucinaciones..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "Qué fastidio, creo que tengo alucinaciones..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "Qué fastidio, creo que tengo alucinaciones..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I've started hallucinating."
msgstr "Qué fastidio, creo que tengo alucinaciones..."

