#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL"
msgid "Taste sweet freedom!"
