msgstr "Antes tengo que bajar de este solomillón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "Siesta in the dark? I think not."
msgstr "¿Siesta en la oscuridad? Creo que no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "This does not strike me as a relaxing place for siesta."
msgstr "Este no me parece que sea un lugar relajado para la siesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE"
msgid "You were too beautiful for this world."
msgstr "Eras demasiado hermosa para este mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT"
