msgstr "No recuerdo que esto estuviera aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "That's almost definitely bigger than before."
msgstr "Casi seguro que antes era más grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
