msgstr "¡Limpio como una patena!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "Too hot for you."
msgstr "Demasiado caliente para ti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "He seems to be a gentle soul."
msgstr "Parece un alma bondadosa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "Would some nice soup make you feel better?"
msgstr "¿Una rica sopa te haría sentirte mejor?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "It doesn't seem dangerous."
msgstr "No parece algo peligroso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A bit of shade is better than none."
msgstr "Un poco de sombra es mejor que nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's missing the key ingredient."
msgstr "Le falta el ingrediente más importante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It is full!"
msgstr "¡Está llena!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "Rich and full of flavor."
msgstr "Cremosa y llena de sabor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "For more savvy construction!"
msgstr "¡Para construcciones más inteligentes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Ahh, a rare attraction!"
msgstr "¡Ahhh, una atracción rara!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "So long as it doesn't blink."
msgstr "Mientras no parpadee..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "I probably shouldn't stir soup with this."
msgstr "Probablemente no debería mover la sopa con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Don't crowd the mushrooms."
msgstr "No llenes las setas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a slathering of butter and chives..."
msgstr "Le hace falta una pizca de mantequilla y cebollino..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Little champignon!"
msgstr "¡Pequeño champignon!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "Did it eat itself...?"
msgstr "¿Se ha comido a sí mismo...?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I eagerly await its rebirth!"
msgstr "¡Aguardo impacientemente su renacimiento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "My, how beautiful!"
msgstr "Pero ¡qué preciosidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "My, how beautiful!"
msgstr "Pero ¡qué preciosidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "More like Greatamole!"
msgstr "¡Más bien grancamole!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Poop of the bat."
msgstr "Caca de murciélago."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Boom!"
msgstr "¡Bum!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "These can be enjoyable, now and then."
msgstr "Pueden ser un puntazo, de vez en cuando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "The younger among us would enjoy it more than me."
msgstr "Los más jóvenes lo disfrutarían más que yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "There are few things I love more than milk chocolate."
msgstr "Hay pocas cosas que me gusten más que el chocolate con leche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "I'm sure it tastes better than it looks."
msgstr "Seguro que sabe mejor de lo que parece."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's a little too sweet for my taste."
msgstr "Demasiado dulce para mi gusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "It sticks in my teeth, but it's well worth it."
msgstr "Se me pega a los dientes, pero merece la pena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "There are better confections available, in my professional opinion."
msgstr "Hay mejores golosinas, según la opinión de un profesional como yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "It could use some butter and salt."
msgstr "Le vendría bien mantequilla y sal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Licorice is only for the most refined palates."
msgstr "El regaliz es solo para los paladares más refinados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "The closest thing I've found to an after dinner mint."
msgstr "Lo más parecido que he encontrado a un caramelo de menta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "I don't think those are fit to eat."
msgstr "No creo que estén para comérselos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Real raisins! Think of the culinary potential."
msgstr "¡Pasas de verdad! Piensa en el potencial culinario."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "I don't need the whole thing, just a couple licks."
msgstr "No lo necesito entero, con un par de lengüetazos basta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "I wouldn't want to ruin my dinner."
msgstr "No me gustaría echar a perder mi cena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "I'm not convinced I want to drink it."
msgstr "No tengo claro que quiera beberme esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "Oof, smells strong."
msgstr "Buf, qué fuerte huele."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "I don't think it'll do much."
msgstr "No creo que haga gran cosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "The fire has caramelized."
msgstr "El fuego se ha caramelizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "I wouldn't drink that, mon ami."
msgstr "Yo no me bebería eso, camarade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Fear upsets my stomach."
msgstr "El miedo me revuelve la tripa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "Its wings are so... leathery."
msgstr "Tiene unas alas... como de cuero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "I'm afraid to touch it."
msgstr "Me da miedo tocarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "I miss calamari."
msgstr "Echo de menos los calamares."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "How creepy."
msgstr "Qué espeluznante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "I'd rather not eat crow."
msgstr "Prefiero no comer cuervo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "Mmm, ham popsicle!"
msgstr "¡Mmm, polo de jamón!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "For tenderizing boeuf!"
msgstr "¡Para ablandar el boeuf!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "It's a heavy duty tenderizer."
msgstr "Es un ablandador de carne todoterreno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Soft and dense, like a well-baked loaf of bread."
msgstr "Mullida pero con consistencia, como un pan bien hecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Wet and unpleasant, like an old spinach salad."
msgstr "Húmeda y desagradable, como una ensalada de espinacas pasada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Light and airy, like a soufflé."
msgstr "Ligera y vaporosa, como un suflé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Stiff and scratchy, like a terrible biscotti."
msgstr "Dura y áspera, como una galleta mal hecha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "The thought of anyone eating this wounds me deeply."
msgstr "La sola idea de que alguien se coma esto me da escalofríos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "When in Rome..."
msgstr "Allá donde fueres..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Soothing."
msgstr "Calmante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "The worse it smells, the better it works?"
msgstr "¿Cuanto peor huele, mejor es el resultado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE"
msgid "A heat-repelling glaze."
msgstr "Un glaseado que aísla contra el calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I like this."
msgstr "Me gusta esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "Still cold."
msgstr "Todavía está fría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Vanilla ice."
msgstr "Helado de vainilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "A temperature stone."
msgstr "Una piedra de temperatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "Hot!"
msgstr "¡Caliente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It's warming up nicely."
msgstr "Se ha puesto a una temperatura agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Alors, some things in life are not as rosy as they seem."
msgstr "Sacrebleu, parece que en la vida no todo es color de rosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Ah, la vie en rose."
msgstr "Ah, la vie en rose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "She's all alone..."
msgstr "Está sola..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "A tasty and toasty brew!"
msgstr "¡Un brebaje delicioso y calentito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "It is a fortifying brew."
msgstr "Es un tónico fortificante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "This mixture will be good for a splitting headache."
msgstr "Este brebaje debe ir bien para el dolor de cabeza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "I wonder what region of the moon this comes from."
msgstr "Me pregunto de qué región de la luna vendrá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "Perfect for soothing un petit madness."
msgstr "Perfecto para calmar una petit locura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Nice but no substitute for a strong brandy."
msgstr "Está bien, pero nada como un buen brandy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "A refreshing summer drink!"
msgstr "¡Una bebida bien refrescante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "I do not mind the taste of this wholesome tonic."
msgstr "Este tónico tan sano no sabe nada mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "How sad!"
msgstr "¡Qué pena!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah. Lovely!"
msgstr "¡Ah, qué preciosidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "Madame Pearl could use a dash more light around here."
msgstr "A madame Perla le vendría bien un poco más de luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "I hope Madame Pearl will like her new home."
msgstr "Espero que a madame Perla le guste su nuevo hogar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "A shortcut to Madame Pearl's!"
msgstr "¡Un atajo para llegar a casa de madame Perla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "Madame Pearl makes a delightful cup of tea."
msgstr "Madame Perla prepara un té delicioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "Madame Pearl's tea is just what I need."
msgstr "El té de madame Perla es justo lo que necesito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "Oh non! Madame's tea shop!"
msgstr "¡Oh, non! ¡La tetería de madame!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "The shop is empty."
msgstr "La tetería está vacía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Perfection!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "An empty basin."
msgstr "Un estanque vacío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, if only I had time for a nice soak."
msgstr "Ah, si tuviera tiempo para un bañito..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "It is still in progress."
msgstr "Aún está en progreso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "I hope she's a bit more comfortable in there now."
msgstr "Espero que ahora esté un poco más cómoda ahí dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "That poor old woman... living here all on her own..."
msgstr "Esa pobre anciana..., viviendo ahí sola..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "Oh dear!"
msgstr "¡Ay, madre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "How quaint!"
msgstr "¡Qué pintoresco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "Not to complain, but I would have preferred a nice edible arrangement."
msgstr "No me quiero quejar, pero habría preferido algo comestible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
