msgstr "Peso: {weight}\nCosecha del día: {day}\n¡Incroyable!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "It may not be substantial in size, but I'm sure it's still substantial in flavor!"
msgstr "Puede que no sea algo copioso, ¡pero seguro que sabe de maravilla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
