msgstr "¡Oye, déjanos en paz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
