#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING"
