msgstr "Qué lenta he sido..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
