msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "Está inactivo en esta hora del día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Requiere hidratación para que pueda crecer nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Roughly hewn wood boards."
msgstr "Tableros de madera toscamente tallados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "They appear to be used as fodder."
msgstr "Parece que los utilizan de forraje."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "We best not underestimate that one."
msgstr "Será mejor no subestimarle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03"
msgid "What a pity."
msgstr "Qué lástima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04"
msgid "What a pity."
msgstr "Qué lástima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05"
msgid "What a pity."
msgstr "Qué lástima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH"
msgid "For repairing hull damages."
msgstr "Para reparar daños en el casco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP"
msgid "A temporary solution, but better than nothing."
msgstr "Una solución temporal, pero es mejor que nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "This should help us stay on course."
msgstr "Esto debería ayudarme a mantener el rumbo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Its placement must be strategic."
msgstr "Debe colocarse en un lugar estratégico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE"
msgid "A shadowy opponent to keep things interesting."
msgstr "Un oponente misterioso para que esto sea más interesante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK"
msgid "Best to avoid that!"
msgstr "¡Será mejor que la evite!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY"
msgid "Best to avoid that!"
msgstr "¡Será mejor que la evite!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "I wouldn't dream of using any underhanded tactics to win. I'll exercise caution."
msgstr "Jamás usaría una táctica tan deshonesta para ganar. Tendré cuidado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "I wouldn't dream of using any underhanded tactics to win. I'll exercise caution."
msgstr "Jamás usaría una táctica tan deshonesta para ganar. Tendré cuidado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING"
msgid "It seems content to watch the proceedings."
msgstr "Parece que este proceso le agrada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START"
msgid "I do love a good old fashioned boat race."
msgstr "¿A quién no le va a gustar una buena regata?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "We must determine the best spot to start and finish the race."
msgstr "Debemos elegir el mejor lugar para iniciar y terminar la carrera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER"
msgid "This vessel is outfitted with a convenient storage receptacle."
msgstr "Este navío está equipado con un receptáculo de almacenamiento la mar de práctico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM"
msgid "The style is reminiscent of the ships from days of old."
msgstr "El estilo evoca el recuerdo de los barcos de la antigüedad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING"
msgid "A thick barrier of geocrustacean exoskeleton."
msgstr "Una gruesa barrera hecha con el exoesqueleto de un geocrustáceo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT"
msgid "It would be wise to equip the boat with a protective barrier."
msgstr "Lo más inteligente sería equipar el barco con una barrera protectora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP"
msgid "A thick barrier of Nereocystis luetkeana."
msgstr "Una gruesa barrera de Nereocystis luetkeana."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT"
msgid "It would be wise to equip the boat with a protective barrier."
msgstr "Lo más inteligente sería equipar el barco con una barrera protectora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL"
msgid "A thick barrier of mollusks."
msgstr "Una gruesa barrera de moluscos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "It would be wise to equip the boat with a protective barrier."
msgstr "Lo más inteligente sería equipar el barco con una barrera protectora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD"
msgid "The effect is admittedly quite striking."
msgstr "Hay que admitir que el efecto es chocante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
msgid "It would be wise to equip the boat with a protective barrier."
msgstr "Lo más inteligente sería equipar el barco con una barrera protectora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED"
msgid "It is not a plaything."
msgstr "No es un juguete."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "A highly effective weapon in nautical combat, when properly loaded."
msgstr "Un arma muy efectiva en el combate naval si se carga correctamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO"
msgid "There's still the small matter of ammunition, dear..."
msgstr "Y aún está el asunto de la munición..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
msgid "A necessary precaution, unfortunately."
msgstr "Por desgracia, es una precaución necesaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM"
msgid "Its durability is questionable, but it will do for now."
msgstr "Su solidez es francamente cuestionable, pero tendrá que servir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM"
msgid "It will allow us to go on the water."
msgstr "Esto nos permitirá navegar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "Our ship is taking on water."
msgstr "Nuestro barco tiene vías de agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED"
msgid "The strong magnetic force will pull my ship toward its target."
msgstr "La potente fuerza magnética atraerá a mi barco hasta su objetivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC"
msgid "Its design is rather eccentric, but the theory is sound."
msgstr "Su diseño es un poco excéntrico, pero la teoría es sólida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED"
msgid "The magnetic beacon has been activated."
msgstr "Se ha activado la baliza magnética."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC"
msgid "It will attract large electromagnets, but only once activated."
msgstr "Atraerá a grandes electroimanes, pero solo cuando esté activada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT"
msgid "I will have to speak with him about the run-on sentences in his directions later."
msgstr "Voy a tener unas palabritas con él sobre las frases demasiado largas en sus instrucciones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR"
msgid "It allows me to rotate the deck, while maintaining our heading."
msgstr "Me permite rotar la cubierta, pero manteniendo el rumbo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT"
msgid "It should improve the boat's maneuverability."
msgstr "Debería mejorar la maniobrabilidad del barco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "The woolen fibers of a beefalo's coat make for excellent padding."
msgstr "Las fibras de la lana del beefalo son un gran relleno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "What a fascinating use of kelp."
msgstr "Qué forma tan fascinante de usar las algas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "It gives off a delicate floral aroma."
msgstr "Desprende un delicado aroma floral."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "This seems ill-suited for a restful night's sleep."
msgstr "No parece muy adecuada para el descanso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Unstable energy, barely held together by a hardy plant epidermis."
msgstr "Una energía muy inestable, unida a duras penas por una firme epidermis vegetal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD"
msgid "Our verdant friend seems to have worked his magic on this."
msgstr "Parece que nuestro amigo verde le ha dado un toque de su propia magia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Remnants of a life well lived."
msgstr "Los restos de una vida bien vivida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "Extremely savory. I wouldn't mind seconds."
msgstr "Un plato extremadamente sabroso. No me importaría repetir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Not quite how mum used to make, but it smells superb!"
msgstr "No es exactamente como el que mamá solía hacer, ¡pero huele muy bien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "Few things are as saddening as the sight of destroyed books."
msgstr "Hay pocas cosas más deprimentes que los libros quemados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Eager minds should always have access to a library."
msgstr "Las mentes dispuestas siempre deberían tener acceso a una biblioteca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "I've grown rather fond of beekeeping."
msgstr "Le he cogido el gusto a la apicultura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "The expurgated version, but it has my favorite: Megascops kennicottii."
msgstr "La versión expurgada, pero tiene mi favorito: Megascops kennicottii."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "What could possibly go wrong?"
msgstr "¿Qué podría salir mal?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "A powerful tome of summoning."
msgstr "Un poderoso tomo de invocación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "Even misfortune offers opportunities to learn. Past mistakes shall not be repeated."
msgstr "Hasta de las desgracias se aprende. No hay que repetir los errores del pasado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "It starts with a rather compelling hook."
msgstr "Tiene mucho gancho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "A tome of accelerated petrification."
msgstr "Un tomo de petrificación acelerada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "Dead plants tied together to help me aid living plants."
msgstr "Plantas muertas juntas para ayudarme con las plantas vivas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "Only my best tricks for bringing a garden to fruition."
msgstr "Los mejores trucos para tener una huerta fructífera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "Mankind has cultivated crops for centuries, and there's still more to learn."
msgstr "La humanidad lleva siglos cultivando y aún nos quedan cosas por aprender."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "I like to do a bit of light reading in the evening."
msgstr "Me gusta leer algo ligero por las noches."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "I've given it a glowing review."
msgstr "Es un análisis francamente brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "Investigating the ancient archives proved to be quite educational."
msgstr "Investigar los archivos antiguos ha resultado ser muy educativo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "A succinct guide, without any extraneous fluff."
msgstr "Una guía concisa, sin trivialidades superfluas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "It took some effort to distill everything down into a single volume."
msgstr "No ha sido nada fácil filtrarlo todo en un solo volumen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "Dead plants tied together to help me aid living plants."
msgstr "Plantas muertas juntas para ayudarme con las plantas vivas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Warm milk in book form."
msgstr "Leche caliente en forma de libro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "You must be mindful of your thermal equilibrium."
msgstr "Hay que tener cuidado con el equilibrio térmico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Hard to put this one down. It's gripping, frankly."
msgstr "Es difícil parar de leerlo. Es apasionante, francamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "Arachnids are crucial parts of a healthy ecosystem, after all."
msgstr "Al fin y al cabo, los arácnidos son cruciales para la salud de un ecosistema."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "It is a flat aerofoil."
msgstr "Es un objeto plano aerodinámico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "As far as teleportation methods go, it's quite unrefined."
msgstr "En lo que a métodos de teletransporte se refiere, no es muy refinado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
msgid "With the right materials, it could be repaired."
msgstr "Con los materiales adecuados aún podría repararse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "A sufficient amount of heat should be enough to reconstitute it."
msgstr "Podría reconstituirse con la cantidad adecuada de calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "Microscopic barbs allow for optimal hair retrieval."
msgstr "La barba microscópica permite la recuperación óptima del pelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "The tool of entomologists."
msgstr "La herramienta de los entomólogos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Nereocystis luetkeana."
msgstr "Nereocystis luetkeana."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
msgid "Nereocystis luetkeana needs time to regrow."
msgstr "Nereocystis luetkeana necesita tiempo para volver a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
msgid "I suppose this is why it's referred to as \"bullwhip\" kelp."
msgstr "Supongo que es por esto por lo que se la conoce como alga \"látigo\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "At least someone's bundled up out here."
msgstr "Este se ha llevado todo el lote."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Antibacterial wrapping for food preservation."
msgstr "Un envoltorio antibacteriano para conservar los alimentos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "A sentient lagomorph."
msgstr "Un lagomorfo sensible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW"
msgid "Caloric, but nutritious. It smells wonderful, as well."
msgstr "Es calórico y nutritivo y, además, huele de maravilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "Reduced to ash."
msgstr "Reducido a cenizas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "Camouflage."
msgstr "Camuflaje."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "Lepidopterous lipids?"
msgstr "¿Lípidos de lepidóptero?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "A colorful lepidopteran."
msgstr "Un lepidóptero colorido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "It is captured."
msgstr "Está capturada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "Who knew butterflies made such nice baked goods?"
msgstr "¿Quién iba a imaginar que las mariposas hicieran repostería tan bonita?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Wings from a captured butterfly."
msgstr "Alas de una mariposa capturada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "Cathartes, of course."
msgstr "Género Cathartes, por supuesto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "This is, in fact, saving it."
msgstr "De hecho, esto lo está salvando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "If only this were the end for the buzzard."
msgstr "Si tan solo este fuese el final para el buitre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "The buzzard is on a different path now... terrible one."
msgstr "Ahora el buitre recorre otro camino... Uno terrible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS"
msgid "Variations of this dish can be found across Europe and Asia."
msgstr "Por Europa y Asia se pueden encontrar variaciones de este plato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "A young barrel cactus."
msgstr "Un cactus de barril joven."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Desperate times, desperate measures."
msgstr "Grandes males, grandes remedios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "Reminds me of Burroughs. A favorite at the library."
msgstr "Me recuerda a Burrows. Uno de mis lectores favoritos en la biblioteca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "I'm not sure it's been prepared properly."
msgstr "No estoy segura de que haya sido debidamente preparado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Delightfully devoid of spines."
msgstr "Deliciosamente desprovista de pinchos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL"
msgid "Delicious makizushi."
msgstr "Un makizushi delicioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "El fuego casi se ha autoextinguido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "A camp fire."
msgstr "Una fogata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Ese fuego está ardiendo a un ritmo alarmante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Al fuego le vendría bien un poco más de combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly average fire."
msgstr "Un fuego perfectamente normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Se puede volver a encender."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Serinus canaria. A historically useful sentinel species."
msgstr "Un Serinus canaria. Una especie centinela de utilidad histórica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "Serinus canaria. We ought never enter a cave without one."
msgstr "Un Serinus canaria. Nunca deberíamos entrar en una cueva sin uno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "Oh, dear."
msgstr "Oh, no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "A festive bag for seasonal treats."
msgstr "Una bolsa festiva para las golosinas de temporada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "I'm no rabologist."
msgstr "No soy pastora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "A suitable projectile for a cannon."
msgstr "Un proyectil apropiado para un cañón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
msgid "Oh, these sorts of things always make such a mess..."
msgstr "Ay, estos trastos siempre lo dejan todo hecho un desastre..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "Thankfully idle, for now."
msgstr "Por suerte, no está activo. Por ahora, claro..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "Let's just put it somewhere far away from the encampment."
msgstr "Será mejor que lo pongamos en algún lugar lejos del campamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "It doesn't actually \"catch\" the light of course, but merely reflects it."
msgstr "No \"atrapa\" la luz de forma literal, claro. Solo la refleja."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "I should be able to assemble it easily enough."
msgstr "No tendría que ser muy difícil de montar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "Those corvids are quite capable craftspeople."
msgstr "Los córvidos son unos artesanos bastante competentes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "I should be able to assemble it easily enough."
msgstr "No tendría que ser muy difícil de montar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "It would look lovely in a little curio cabinet, don't you think?"
msgstr "Quedaría muy bien en una vitrina, ¿no crees?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "I believe this is among the rarest of the whole collection."
msgstr "Creo que es de las más raras de toda la colección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "It appears to be of a slightly upgraded rarity."
msgstr "Creo que es de una rareza superior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "How intriguing! I wonder what's inside?"
msgstr "¡Qué emoción! ¿Qué habrá dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "How intriguing! I wonder what's inside?"
msgstr "¡Qué emoción! ¿Qué habrá dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP"
msgid "It has a most curious light source."
msgstr "Tiene una fuente de luz bastante curiosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "I should be able to assemble it easily enough."
msgstr "No tendría que ser muy difícil de montar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT"
msgid "It's so soothing to care for a small tree."
msgstr "Cuidar de un arbolito me relaja muchísimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "I wouldn't mind a bit of gardening."
msgstr "No me importaría dedicarle un ratito a la huerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "An acquired taste, but nevertheless quite refreshing."
msgstr "Tienes que acostumbrarte al sabor, pero es bastante refrescante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD"
msgid "Colorful paper representations of Annelida."
msgstr "Representaciones en papel de Annelida de muchos colores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST"
msgid "Part of the mechanism for the game, I'd imagine."
msgstr "Supongo que es una parte del mecanismo del juego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "The game appears to require quick reflexes."
msgstr "Hay que tener bastantes reflejos para jugar a esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK"
msgid "Go on now, scoot!"
msgstr "¡Venga, rápido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "This looks like a good bit of exercise."
msgstr "Seguro que con esto se hace bastante ejercicio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Part of the mechanism for the game, I'd imagine."
msgstr "Supongo que es una parte del mecanismo del juego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING"
msgid "I believe it was this one here."
msgstr "Creo que es esta de aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Ah! A simple test of one's aptitude for memorization."
msgstr "Vaya, esto pone a prueba la capacidad de memorización de la gente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "A game of odds and probability."
msgstr "Se basa en el azar y la probabilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING"
msgid "This appears to trigger the firing mechanism."
msgstr "Parece que esto activa el mecanismo disparador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "One's timing must be precise to win."
msgstr "Hay que hacerlo en el momento justo para ganar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC"
msgid "Part of the mechanism for the game, I'd imagine."
msgstr "Supongo que es una parte del mecanismo del juego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING"
msgid "It appears the object is to hit the insects while sparing the birds."
msgstr "Parece que el objetivo es alcanzar a los insectos, pero no a los pájaros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe it requires a form of currency to start."
msgstr "Creo que necesita algún tipo de divisa para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Curious. It seems that it's designed to be impossible to lose."
msgstr "Qué curioso, parece que está diseñada para que perder sea imposible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "I don't want to see anyone playing with this near any breakables."
msgstr "No quiero ver a nadie jugando con esto cerca de algo que se pueda romper."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID"
msgid "Corvids are remarkably intelligent, I'd imagine this species is even more so."
msgstr "Los córvidos son muy inteligentes, así que seguro que esta especie lo es todavía más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "A form of avian currency, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Será algún tipo de divisa aviar?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST"
msgid "He's a rather curious character."
msgstr "Es un hombre bastante peculiar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC"
msgid "It seems customary to place decorations around it."
msgstr "Parece que es costumbre decorar este lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2"
msgid "Oh yes, that's coming along quite nicely!"
msgstr "Qué bien, ¡está quedando de maravilla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
msgid "That appears to be an acceptable level of decoration."
msgstr "Creo que ya tiene un nivel de decoración aceptable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "What an intriguing specimen... I can't quite pinpoint the subspecies."
msgstr "Qué espécimen tan intrigante... No consigo identificar cuál es la subespecie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "There is a surprisingly varied selection to choose from."
msgstr "Tienen una selección de premios bastante variada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "It appears simple enough to construct."
msgstr "Parece sencillo de construir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC"
msgid "I should be able to exchange these for a prize of some sort."
msgstr "Supongo que podré cambiarlos por algún tipo de premio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK"
msgid "I seem to be quite good at these games!"
msgstr "¡Se me dan bastante bien estos juegos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK"
msgid "I assume the more tickets I collect, the greater the prize will be."
msgstr "Supongo que, cuantos más tíquets tenga, mejor será el premio que consiga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "A bit of extra fiber added to one's diet never hurts."
msgstr "Añadir un poco más de fibra a la dieta nunca viene mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "The corvids seem to have developed a method of fabricating clothing from leaves."
msgstr "Los córvidos han desarrollado un método para fabricar ropa con hojas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "How fascinating that these corvids have evolved to the point of wearing clothing."
msgstr "Me fascina el hecho de que los córvidos hayan evolucionado tanto que incluso llevan ropa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "It smells deligthfully of summer leaves."
msgstr "Desprende un olor divino a hojas veraniegas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "A moon glass saw blade. Sharp enough to cut stone."
msgstr "Una sierra de cristal lunar. Está tan afilada que puede cortar piedra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
msgid "I suppose my reading chair will have to wait."
msgstr "Supongo que mi silla de lectura va a tener que esperar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I could use a new reading chair."
msgstr "No me vendría mal una nueva silla de lectura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "Perhaps that was unnecessary."
msgstr "Quizá eso era innecesario."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "My, another plant and animal hybrid. How odd."
msgstr "Vaya, otro híbrido de planta y animal. Qué extraño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "The plant and animal matter has fused in total harmony."
msgstr "Las materias vegetal y animal se han fusionado en total armonía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's in a deep sleep."
msgstr "Está en un profundo sueño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
msgid "Fascinating! A new genus, perhaps?"
msgstr "¡Fascinante! ¿Un nuevo género, quizá?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Daucus carota. Edible, and delicious."
msgstr "Daucus carota. Comestible y deliciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Daucus carota, roasted to perfection."
msgstr "Daucus carota, asada a la perfección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "The result of proper research, planning and care."
msgstr "Es el resultado de la investigación, la planificación y el cariño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "Daucus carota is a root vegetable."
msgstr "Daucus carota es una raíz vegetal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "No empezará a crecer hasta que no la plantemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Can we have nothing decent?"
msgstr "¿No podemos tener nada decente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "The destruction of knowledge is such a difficult thing to stomach."
msgstr "La destrucción del conocimiento es algo tan difícil de soportar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah! A proper desk! Just look at the finish on that wood!"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Un escritorio en condiciones! ¡Fíjate en el acabado de esa madera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "A sort of a wildcat. Handsome fellow."
msgstr "Una especie de gato montés. Un animal bonito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks used up."
msgstr "Parece usado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "An excellent hollow for a den."
msgstr "Un excelente hueco para una guarida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Not quite like Crockett's, but it'll do."
msgstr "No es exactamente como el de Crockett, pero servirá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "A simple mechanism behind an entertaining toy for felines."
msgstr "Un mecanismo muy simple para un juguete para los felinos muy entretenido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks as though it can be moved."
msgstr "Parece que se puede mover."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "We must clear the surrounding boulders first."
msgstr "Primero debemos despejar las rocas circundantes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "All of them are genetically identical."
msgstr "Todos son genéticamente idénticos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "I do not believe this one can be restored."
msgstr "No creo que se pueda restaurar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Somewhat better."
msgstr "Un poco mejor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "The seeds must have fallen down a sinkhole."
msgstr "Las semillas deben de haber caído en un sumidero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "The placement of that rock looks intentional."
msgstr "La colocación de esa roca parece intencionada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "Much too crowded for my liking."
msgstr "Demasiado concurrido para mi gusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps when I am better prepared."
msgstr "Tal vez cuando esté mejor preparada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "The subterranean world awaits."
msgstr "El mundo subterráneo espera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "The passage has been obstructed."
msgstr "El paso ha sido obstruido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "With all those people? It's bound to be cacophony."
msgstr "¿Con todas esas personas? Seguro que hay cacofonías."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps later."
msgstr "Quizás más tarde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "Maybe I should go back up for some fresh air."
msgstr "Tal vez debería salir un poco a tomar el aire fresco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "A lovely ornamental plant."
msgstr "Una planta ornamental preciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED"
msgid "It is quite dead."
msgstr "Está bastante muerto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD"
msgid "This one is deceased."
msgstr "Esta está muerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC"
msgid "This mineral hybrid creature possesses the ability to store gas under considerable pressure."
msgstr "Esta criatura mineral híbrida posee la capacidad de almacenar gas a gran presión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is dormant at the moment."
msgstr "Ahora mismo está durmiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING"
msgid "It is venting gas as a form of attack."
msgstr "Expulsa gas como forma de ataque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS"
msgid "Those fumes are harmful to inhale and will cause spoilage to perishables."
msgstr "Inhalar esos gases es dañino y deteriorará los perecederos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Fumarole from which a number of gasses may emerge. Best steer clear."
msgstr "Una fumarola de la que podrían emanar ciertos gases. Será mejor que la evitemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "Merely geothermal steam venting from a fumarole. One needn't be alarmed."
msgstr "Vapor geotérmico emanando de una fumarola. No hay necesitad de alarmarse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "Prudence dictates minimizing exposure to that most insidious vapor."
msgstr "Lo más prudente será minimizar la exposición a ese vapor maligno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "A tried and true means of escape."
msgstr "Una ruta de escape atada y bien atada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Could use a little more sauce."
msgstr "Le hace falta un poco más de salsa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "It's mostly carbon and ash."
msgstr "Es principalmente carbón y cenizas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "It requires materials."
msgstr "Necesita materiales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "I wouldn't classify their criticism as constructive."
msgstr "Sus críticas no son precisamente constructivas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "It lists the characters in the next act."
msgstr "Enumera a los personajes del próximo acto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "I'd like to give that young lady a stern talking to!"
msgstr "¡Voy a tener que tener una buena charla con esa jovencita!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "The builder must have been inspired by the Greek dramas of antiquity."
msgstr "Quién lo construyó debió inspirarse en los antiguos dramas griegos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "¿Los proyectos inacabados del mago?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "¿Los proyectos inacabados del mago?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "The magician's unfinished projects?"
msgstr "¿Los proyectos inacabados del mago?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "Artists tend to reference what they're familiar with."
msgstr "Los artistas tienden a hacer referencia a lo que conocen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "A stately statuary of the Panthera auropunctata."
msgstr "Una señorial estatua de la Panthera auropunctata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "Quite expressive!"
msgstr "¡Muy expresivo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "The artist truly captured its ferocity!"
msgstr "¡El artista ha conseguido reflejar su ferocidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "It captures my beefalo's likeness quite well."
msgstr "Refleja la apariencia de mi beefalo a la perfección."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "A queenly tribute to the Apis mellifera."
msgstr "Un regio tributo a la Apis mellifera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "A decorative stone carving of a bishop chess piece."
msgstr "Una piedra decorativa tallada con forma de alfil de ajedrez."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Parece que aquí hay magia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "Carved in the lunar moth's likeness."
msgstr "Esculpida para parecerse a la mariposa luna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "A delightfully rendered likeness of the Daucus carota rattus."
msgstr "Tiene un delicioso parecido a la Daucus carota rattus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "The resemblance to the Felis lybica is incredible."
msgstr "El parecido con el Felis lybica es impresionante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "A replica of Canis lupis."
msgstr "Una réplica de Canis lupis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "The sculptor clearly studied the creature closely."
msgstr "El escultor estudió claramente a la criatura de cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "A rendering of a treasure-obsessed crustacean."
msgstr "Una representación de un crustáceo obsesionado con los tesoros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "An accurate stone model of that ill-behaved creature."
msgstr "Una fiel representación en piedra de esa criatura tan maleducada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "Resourceful, admittedly. Yet, in essence, a brute."
msgstr "Admito que es hábil. Pero, en el fondo, no deja de ser un bruto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "An anatomical study of those strange beasts."
msgstr "Un estudio anatómico de esas bestias extrañas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "Such a strange and grotesque affliction..."
msgstr "Un mal tan extraño y grotesco..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "One of the hungriest large invertebrates."
msgstr "Uno de los grandes invertebrados más hambrientos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Artist's interpretation of mythical Diptera."
msgstr "Una interpretación artística de la mítica Diptera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "A trophy that doubles as a useful anatomical model."
msgstr "Un trofeo que sirve como modelo anatómico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "The king is, by all measures, a liability to everyone on the board."
msgstr "El rey es, indiscutiblemente, una responsabilidad de cada uno en el tablero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "I must commend the artist for their attention to detail."
msgstr "Tendría que felicitar al artista por demostrar tal minuciosidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "It is a commonly held belief that art imitates life."
msgstr "Es una creencia común que el arte imita la vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "I should warn the children not to play too close to it."
msgstr "Debería decirles a los niños que no jueguen cerca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "A wonderfully seasonal simulacrum."
msgstr "Un simulacro maravillosamente estacional."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A knight, in service to the king. Or perhaps the queen."
msgstr "Un caballo, al servicio del rey. O quizás de la reina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Parece que aquí hay magia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "I'll have to add an appendix to \"Birds of the World\"."
msgstr "Tendré que añadir un apéndice a \"Aves del mundo\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "Those lagomorphs are quite the rascals."
msgstr "Esos lagomorfos son unos granujas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "A rather convincing likeness."
msgstr "Un parecido de lo más convincente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "The missing chunk is a recent development."
msgstr "Que le falte un trozo es una novedad reciente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "Bust of Alces canadensis."
msgstr "Un busto de Alces canadensis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "In chess, the queen is by far the most strategically formidable."
msgstr "En el ajedrez, la reina es de lejos la que tiene mejor estrategia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "Pawns that journey to the seat of power can be quite dangerous."
msgstr "Los peones que buscan una posición de poder pueden ser muy peligrosos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I hope this does not have a bad influence on the children."
msgstr "Espero que esto no sea mala influencia para los niños."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Represents the protective walls of the king's castle."
msgstr "Representa los muros protectores del castillo del rey."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "It seems magic is afoot."
msgstr "Parece que aquí hay magia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "The mouthiest of its species."
msgstr "El más bocazas de su especie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "The artist faithfully replicated its skeletal structure."
msgstr "El artista ha reproducido fielmente su estructura ósea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "The artist captured the parasitic relationship beautifully."
msgstr "El artista ha captado a la perfección la relación parasitaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "A stone rendition of a pair of mechanical marvels."
msgstr "Una representación de piedra de dos maravillas mecánicas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "It proved a marvel of ancient architecture."
msgstr "Una maravilla de la arquitectura ancestral."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "This dreadful amalgamation was unprecedented."
msgstr "Una amalgama horrible y sin precedentes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "A miniature of the homicidal automaton. Hm."
msgstr "Una miniatura del autómata homicida. Vaya."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "There is much I still don't understand about this beast."
msgstr "Aún hay muchas cosas de esta bestia que no entiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "This ancestor of the predatory annelid was far worse."
msgstr "Este ancestro del anélido depredador era mucho peor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "A curious combination; the fire-breathing Diptera and seafaring."
msgstr "Una combinación muy curiosa: el díptero escupefuego y la navegación."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "This mechanical knight demonstrates loyalty to whomever dons the garb of its charge."
msgstr "Este caballo mecánico solo es leal a aquellos que portan el atuendo de su orden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "One of the hungriest large invertebrates."
msgstr "Uno de los grandes invertebrados más voraces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "A motile storage chest."
msgstr "Un cofre de almacenamiento móvil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oculus Mysterium."
msgstr "Oculus mysterium."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "The oculus is inactive."
msgstr "El óculo está inactivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Increases the capacity of a storage container by a, frankly, absurd degree."
msgstr "Aumenta la capacidad de un contenedor de almacenamiento de forma absurda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "This creature mimics an artifact."
msgstr "Esta criatura imita a un artefacto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHUM"
msgid "I find it best not to dwell on what it's made of."
msgstr "Encuentro que es mejor no preocuparse por saber cómo se ha hecho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "The earthenware has been magically animated."
msgstr "El barro ha sido animado por arte de magia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Terra cotta earthenware."
msgstr "Barro de terracota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, how charmingly fearsome."
msgstr "Ah, qué temible y encantador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "An intricately crafted terra cotta statue."
msgstr "Una intrincada estatua de terracota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "El fuego casi se ha autoextinguido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "A rather strange, magical fire pit."
msgstr "Un hoyo de fuego bastante extraño y mágico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Ese fuego está ardiendo a un ritmo alarmante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Al fuego le vendría bien un poco más de combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly unusual fire."
msgstr "Un fuego perfectamente inusual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Se puede volver a encender."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "El fuego casi se ha autoextinguido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire pit. It's chilly."
msgstr "Un hoyo de fuego. Está frío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Ese fuego está ardiendo a un ritmo alarmante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel, whatever fuel it takes."
msgstr "Al fuego le vendría bien algo más del combustible que utilice."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "A fire. Of some kind."
msgstr "Un fuego. De algún tipo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Se puede volver a encender."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST"
msgid "It would be prudent to rebuild the chest, rather than leave all this lying about."
msgstr "Lo más sensato sería reconstruir el cofre, en lugar de dejar todo esto tirado por ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "Este."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "The coordinates remain unknown."
msgstr "Las coordenadas siguen siendo desconocidas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North."
msgstr "Norte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast."
msgstr "Nordeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest."
msgstr "Noroeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "South."
msgstr "Sur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast."
msgstr "Sureste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "Sudoeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "Oeste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOST"
msgid "The secret to any garden's success is nutrient-rich soil."
msgstr "El secreto para tener una buena cosecha es usar tierra con muchos nutrientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "A well balanced mix."
msgstr "Una mezcla bien equilibrada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "Well... I suppose plants need carbon too."
msgstr "Bueno... Supongo que las plantas también necesitan carbono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "It requires a bit more moisture."
msgstr "Necesita un poco más de agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Composting is an essential component to gardening."
msgstr "El compost es un componente esencial de la horticultura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET"
msgid "The moisture level of this mixture is too high."
msgstr "El nivel de humedad de esta mezcla es demasiado alto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP"
msgid "Oh dear. Those are some large droppings."
msgstr "Oh, no. Esos son unos grandes excrementos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "Oh, I do like the look of this."
msgstr "Oh, me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK"
msgid "A collection of culinary observations."
msgstr "Una colección de observaciones culinarias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "Mandragora officinarum, cooked in the name of discovery."
msgstr "Mandragora officinarum, cocinada en el nombre del descubrimiento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "It is slightly more appetizing when cooked."
msgstr "Es un poco más apetecible cuando está cocinada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "It's still a little bit poisonous."
msgstr "Todavía es un poco venenosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "It is slightly more appetizing when cooked."
msgstr "Es un poco más apetecible cuando está cocinada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER"
msgid "Its eyes seem fixed to my raft."
msgstr "Sus ojos parecen estar fijos en mi balsa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT"
msgid "Hm, it has a very disagreeable odor."
msgstr "Hum, tiene un color muy desagradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL"
msgid "A thick casing of calcium carbonate."
msgstr "Una gruesa carcasa de carbonato de calcio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh dear, I can't seem to make any sense of it."
msgstr "Oh, cielos, no entiendo un pimiento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "Now it's truly derelict."
msgstr "Ahora está verdaderamente abandonado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "It's got a bit to go before it's ready."
msgstr "Falta un poco antes de que esté listo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Almost done!"
msgstr "¡Casi listo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Supper time!"
msgstr "¡Hora de cenar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "It looks derelict when it's not cooking something."
msgstr "Parece abandonada cuando no está cocinando algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COOLANT"
msgid "The fluids exhibit anomalous properties, no doubt catalyzed by the mutations."
msgstr "Los fluidos muestran propiedades anómalas. Sin duda se deben a las mutaciones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "A flexible torso appendage."
msgstr "Un apéndice de torso flexible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "Zea mays, a great staple food."
msgstr "Zea mays, un gran alimento básico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Popped corn!"
msgstr "¡Palomitas de maíz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Quite an impressive harvest."
msgstr "Es una cosecha bastante impresionante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "No empezará a crecer hasta que no la plantemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY"
msgid "These garments are indicative of royal status."
msgstr "Estos ropajes sugieren un estatus real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY"
msgid "It appears to be a theatrical costume."
msgstr "Parece el vestuario de una obra de teatro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC"
msgid "A small fire is needed to achieve the full effect."
msgstr "Necesita una pequeña llama para que el efecto sea completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT"
msgid "This statue seems to have fallen into disrepair."
msgstr "Parece que la estatua no está en muy buen estado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC"
msgid "A small fire is needed to achieve the full effect."
msgstr "Necesita una pequeña llama para que el efecto sea completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
msgid "What a charming statue."
msgstr "Qué estatua tan bonita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire is needed to achieve the full effect."
msgstr "Necesita fuego para que el efecto sea completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT"
msgid "The firelight reflecting against the gold surface is almost hypnotic."
msgstr "La luz del fuego reflejada sobre la superficie dorada es casi hipnótica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET"
msgid "Oh dear, did it just blink at me?"
msgstr "Ay, madre, ¿acaba de parpadear?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "They look quite comfortable."
msgstr "Parecen bastante cómodos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder if its size is natural or caused by lunar mutations?"
msgstr "Me pregunto si su tamaño es natural o está causado por mutaciones lunares."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "Those impressions appear to have been made to house gems."
msgstr "Esas marcas parecen estar hechas para alojar gemas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "Curious. These crustaceans have learned to launch projectiles."
msgstr "Qué curioso. Estos crustáceos han aprendido a disparar proyectiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "Thank goodness I'm not allergic to shellfish."
msgstr "Gracias a Dios que no soy alérgica al marisco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "A solid but not impenetrable layer of defense."
msgstr "Una barrera defensiva sólida pero no impenetrable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "The crabs are protecting their king."
msgstr "Los cangrejos están protegiendo a su rey."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "That is one brute of a decapod."
msgstr "Es un decápodo excepcionalmente bruto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "A perfect hollow for nesting animals."
msgstr "Un hueco perfecto para que aniden los animales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "Are you animal or vegetable, dear?"
msgstr "¿Eres animal o vegetal, querido?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "What a darling Diptera juvenile!"
msgstr "¡Qué bonita Diptera juvenil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS"
msgid "It seems to have a liking for confectionary treats such as cakes."
msgstr "Parece que le gusta la confitería."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Now, I wonder if your nerves are functional, or merely decorative..."
msgstr "¿Los nervios son funcionales? ¿O son solo decorativos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "How do you maintain flight, dear?"
msgstr "¿Cómo mantienes el vuelo, querido?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "Now it feels like home."
msgstr "Ahora está como en casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "I could just squish that widdle face."
msgstr "Me dan ganas de apretar esa carita tierna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "Who wuvs their widdle specimen?"
msgstr "¿Quién quiere a su espécimen meón?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "What a handsome poult you are!"
msgstr "¡Qué pavo tan apuesto eres!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Who's the sweetest little Canis lupus?"
msgstr "¿Quién es el Canis lupus más bonito?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Corvus brachyrhynchos."
msgstr "Corvus brachyrhynchos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "A perfectly handsome specimen."
msgstr "Un ejemplar perfectamente hermoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "I believe this came from the walking confectionery."
msgstr "Creo que esto viene del dulce andarín."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "Primitive jewelry."
msgstr "Joya primitiva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "Some grass cuttings."
msgstr "Un poco de hierba cortada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "It may be a suitable plaything for the children, if they behave themselves."
msgstr "Podría ser un buen juguete para los niños, siempre que se comporten, claro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "This won't last long."
msgstr "No va a durar mucho tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Some rush cuttings."
msgstr "Algunos juncos cortados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Some smoothed rock slabs."
msgstr "Algunas placas de roca pulida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "This creature has terrible manners."
msgstr "Esta criatura tiene unos modales nefastos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "My, how did it end up in this state?"
msgstr "Vaya, ¿qué habrá hecho para acabar así?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "The pitiful beast is pinned beneath this pile of debris."
msgstr "La pobre bestia ha quedado atrapada bajo esta montaña de basura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "The creature appears calm for now. Best not aggravate it."
msgstr "La criatura parece tranquila. Será mejor no irritarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "Someone should teach this brute some manners."
msgstr "Alguien debería enseñarle modales a esa bestia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "It will require much greater force than I can muster to break it."
msgstr "Se necesitará una fuerza mucho mayor que la mía para romperlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "How odd... the marble appears to be encasing something."
msgstr "Qué extraño... Parece que el mármol envuelve algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "I'm not sure that's good to eat."
msgstr "No estoy segura de que sea bueno comer esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "What curious skeletal structures."
msgstr "Qué estructuras esqueléticas más curiosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "El árbol está ardiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Un árbol carbonizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Ha sido cosechado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fagales of some kind. It bears fruit when fully grown."
msgstr "Fagales de algún tipo. Dan frutos cuando están bien desarrollados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "That is no tree I've seen before!"
msgstr "¡No he visto antes este árbol!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Do we have enough players for Bridge?"
msgstr "¿Tenemos jugadores suficientes para un bridge?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "I suppose it's pretty, but it doesn't do much."
msgstr "Supongo que es bonito, pero no sirve para nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "Ah, could use a doily, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Ah, le vendría bien un mantel, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "The more light to read by the better, in my opinion."
msgstr "Cuanta más luz haya para leer, mejor, en mi opinión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's pleasant to see a little decor out here."
msgstr "Es agradable ver un poco de decoración por aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It is Maxwell's turn to procure bulbs. I've it written down right here."
msgstr "Le toca a Maxwell conseguir bombillas. Lo he escrito aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "A pity. Shall we find replacements?"
msgstr "Una pena. ¿Buscamos repuesto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "Now I can read my books at night."
msgstr "Ahora puedo leer por la noche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure. Why not?"
msgstr "Claro. ¿Por qué no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "All art begins with a blank page."
msgstr "El arte siempre empieza con un lienzo en blanco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "A decent resemblance."
msgstr "El parecido es aceptable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Its antler has grown in for winter."
msgstr "Su cornamenta ha crecido para el invierno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "It has shed its antler for the warmer months."
msgstr "Ha mudado sus astas para los meses más cálidos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Laurasiatheria!"
msgstr "¡Laurasiaterios!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "It's the safest course of action."
msgstr "Es la opción más segura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It might be prudent to dispose of the body."
msgstr "Será mejor que me deshaga del cuerpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Goodness! Something is reanimating the body!"
msgstr "¡Cielo santo! ¡Algo está reanimando el cuerpo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "An implement that conditions the air, or ambient-temperature-reduction-device for short."
msgstr "Un instrumento que condiciona el aire. O un dispositivo de reducción de la temperatura ambiente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "It is rendered useless without the eye of that beast."
msgstr "Sin el ojo de la bestia no sirve para nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "It should be a simple matter to construct it."
msgstr "No debería ser un montaje muy complicado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "I feel a vague sense of accomplishment."
msgstr "Siento una vaga sensación de logro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "It looks like a key, but it's quite brittle."
msgstr "Parece una llave, pero es bastante frágil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "The poor creature has been forcibly fused to a magic gem."
msgstr "Han fusionado por la fuerza a la pobre criatura con una gema mágica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A tuft of a graminoid."
msgstr "Un manojo de gramíneas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Much more effective than reading glasses."
msgstr "Mucho más eficaz que las gafas de leer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "It will help me be rid of excess moisture."
msgstr "Me ayudará a eliminar el exceso de humedad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "This should keep me comfortably dry."
msgstr "Esto debería mantenerme bien seca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Unhygienic!"
msgstr "¡Antihigiénico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "The dial is moving faintly."
msgstr "El dial se mueve ligeramente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a magitechnical homing device."
msgstr "Es un dispositivo de rastreo mágico-técnico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Here we are!"
msgstr "¡Aquí estamos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "This is definitely the right track."
msgstr "Este es definitivamente el camino correcto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Must be getting close."
msgstr "Debo estar acercándome."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It will need some work before it can function."
msgstr "Habrá que trabajar en ella para que pueda funcionar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It simply needs a key now."
msgstr "Ahora solo necesita una llave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "Ah. The beauty of functionality."
msgstr "Ah. La belleza de la funcionalidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "This rod could be useful!"
msgstr "¡Esta vara podría ser útil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "Some essential materials for constructing a wharf."
msgstr "Los materiales básicos para construir un embarcadero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "Unnecessary for a floating dock, but they do have a pleasant appearance."
msgstr "Son innecesarios para un muelle flotante, pero le dan un toque agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "A bit childish for my tastes."
msgstr "Es un poco infantil para mi gusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "It would make sense to construct this near the water."
msgstr "Tendría sentido construirlo cerca del agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "Everything I need has been conveniently collected into a singular package."
msgstr "Todo cuanto necesito empaquetado de forma muy práctica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "The longer the dragon, the better the luck."
msgstr "Cuanto más largo sea el dragón, más suerte da."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "I do like fresh greens."
msgstr "Me gustan las verduras frescas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's some kind of mythical variant of a Diptera."
msgstr "Es una especie de variante mítica de un díptero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Scales! Scales are the winner!"
msgstr "¡Escamas! ¡Las escamas triunfan!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "A fireproof chest with an impossibly expansive interior."
msgstr "Un cofre ignífugo con un interior extremadamente extenso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "A very efficient, magically powered furnace."
msgstr "Un horno muy eficiente de potencia mágica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "Hm, that was an interesting choice of alteration."
msgstr "Hmm, ha sido una modificación interesante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "The magic of the two gems keeps it burning at maximum strength."
msgstr "La magia de las dos gemas lo mantiene ardiendo a máxima potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "It is burning at half strength, presently."
msgstr "Está ardiendo a media potencia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "Hylocereus undatus, or pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Hylocereus undatus o pitahaya blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "Pleasantly prepared pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Pitahaya blanca gratamente preparada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "The result of proper research, planning and care."
msgstr "Es el resultado de la investigación, la planificación y el cariño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "No empezará a crecer hasta que no la plantemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "This is the head to the dragon costume."
msgstr "Esta es la cabeza del traje de dragón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "I do love a nice fruit pie."
msgstr "Me encanta un buen pastel de frutas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "This is the back of the dragon costume."
msgstr "Esta es la parte trasera del traje de dragón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "Scales from an insect? Unheard of!"
msgstr "¿Escamas de un insecto? ¡Nunca he oído hablar de él!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "Metamorphic, if I'm not mistaken."
msgstr "Metamórfica, si no me equivoco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "Unfortunately, the material seems to have adverse affects on the mind."
msgstr "Por desgracia, parece que el material tiene efectos secundarios sobre la mente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "Its source must lie even deeper underground."
msgstr "Su fuente debe encontrarse en algún lugar subterráneo aún más profundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "A naturally buoyant material."
msgstr "Un material flotante por naturaleza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "El árbol está ardiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Carbonized, through and through."
msgstr "Carbonizado por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Little of use remains."
msgstr "Queda poco que sea de utilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A new material may be of some use to us."
msgstr "Un nuevo material puede sernos de ayuda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "A leg of poultry."
msgstr "Un muslo de ave de corral."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Not terribly healthy, but my is it delicious!"
msgstr "¡No es muy saludable, pero es deliciosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "The fruit is remarkably similar to our own subterranean strain."
msgstr "La fruta es excepcionalmente similar a nuestra variante subterránea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Requiere suelo para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Requiere tierra para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Requiere suelo para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Requiere suelo para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "A variation of the common Typha latifolia, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Será una variante de la Typha latifolia común?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Requiere suelo para crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "It is no longer a danger."
msgstr "Ya no supone un peligro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Un poco de ejercicio es bueno para la salud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "My, it's ice-cold to the touch!"
msgstr "¡Vaya, está helada al tacto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Un poco de ejercicio es bueno para la salud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Un poco de ejercicio es bueno para la salud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "An interesting combination of exercise and temperature regulation."
msgstr "Una combinación muy interesante de ejercicio y regulación de temperatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Un poco de ejercicio es bueno para la salud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "Careful dear, that looks suspiciously combustible."
msgstr "Cuidado, parece sospechosamente inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Aha, the Durio zibethinus. It really does reek."
msgstr "Ajá, el Durio zibethinus. Realmente apesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking this certainly did not improve its odor."
msgstr "Cocinar esto ciertamente no ha mejorado su olor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Oh, our diminutive green friend will be thrilled!"
msgstr "¡A nuestra amiguita verde y diminuta le va a encantar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "No empezará a crecer hasta que no la plantemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "Perhaps there's a creature around here that could metabolize this."
msgstr "A lo mejor hay alguna criatura por aquí que puede metabolizar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "I would have been quite pleased to have one helping me in the library."
msgstr "Me habría encantado tener una que me ayudara en la biblioteca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "It seems a chemical reaction within the bodies of these creatures creates Thulecite."
msgstr "Parece ser que la tulecita se crea a partir de una reacción química en los cuerpos de estas criaturas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Poor Leporidae. At least it's warm."
msgstr "Pobre lepórido. Al menos calienta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "It's an eel."
msgstr "Es una anguila."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "This eel has been cooked."
msgstr "Esta anguila ha sido cocinada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "A nightshade. Solanum melongena, specifically."
msgstr "Una belladona. Una Solanum melongena, específicamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "For your enjoyment: Braised Solanum melongena."
msgstr "Para tu disfrute: una Solanum melongena asada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A particularly resplendent Solanum melongena."
msgstr "Una Solanum melongena espléndida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "No empezará a crecer hasta que no la plantemos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "What a pretty elixir organizer!"
msgstr "¡Un organizador de elixires muy bonito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "Nothing like some unnatural fire to warm yourself with on a chilly day."
msgstr "No hay nada como un buen fuego antinatural para calentarse en un día frío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, such as it is."
msgstr "Bien, se acabó."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Ah, could use a doily, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Ah, le vendría bien un mantel, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "The more light to read by the better, in my opinion."
msgstr "Cuanta más luz haya para leer, mejor, en mi opinión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's pleasant to see a little decor out here."
msgstr "Es agradable ver un poco de decoración por aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It is Maxwell's turn to procure bulbs. I've it written down right here."
msgstr "Le toca a Maxwell conseguir bombillas. Lo he escrito aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "A pity. Shall we find replacements?"
msgstr "Una pena. ¿Buscamos repuesto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "El árbol está ardiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Un árbol carbonizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Ha sido cosechado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A generically coniferous tree."
msgstr "Un árbol genéricamente conífero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "El árbol está ardiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Un árbol carbonizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Ha sido cosechado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "This genus seems to lack reproductive capabilities."
msgstr "Este género parece carecer de capacidades reproductivas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "The cornea must be quite water-repellent."
msgstr "La córnea debe ser bastante repelente del agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "I doubt that they make my prescription in this size."
msgstr "Dudo que tengan mi graduación de este tamaño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Oculus dexter or oculus sinister, I wonder? I have a suspicion it's the latter."
msgstr "¿Ojo diestro u ojo siniestro? Algo me dice que es lo segundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "I'm fascinated, but now is not the time to study you."
msgstr "Me fascina, pero no es el momento de analizar nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "An eyeball... embryo? These creatures are quite perplexing."
msgstr "Un... ¿embrión de ojo? Estas criaturas son desconcertantes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "I believe they are controlled by the larger plant."
msgstr "Creo que están controladas por la planta más grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "The magic of the two beasts has been concentrated by the Thulecite."
msgstr "La magia de las dos bestias se ha concentrado en la tulecita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "I'll need to place this."
msgstr "Necesito colocar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "It shan't grow a crop again."
msgstr "No volverá a crecer un cultivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "A small cultivated patch of ground."
msgstr "Un pequeño trozo de tierra cultivada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "The plants are extracting minerals from the ground."
msgstr "Las plantas extraen minerales del suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "It has been rendered infertile for lack of nutrients."
msgstr "Está estéril por falta de nutrientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Humans have cultivated crops since Neolithic times."
msgstr "Los humanos llevan cultivando desde el neolítico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "What an unfortunate turn of events!"
msgstr "¡Qué pena de situación!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "I daresay that's ready to harvest."
msgstr "Me atrevo a decir que ya se puede cosechar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How splendid!"
msgstr "¡Qué esplendor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Weeds have no place in the garden."
msgstr "No tendría que haber malas hierbas en la huerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Of the kingdom Plantae."
msgstr "Es del reino Plantae."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "It's coming along."
msgstr "El crecimiento sigue su curso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "I detest the sight of spoiled food!"
msgstr "¡Detesto ver comida caducada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How terrible to see it all go to waste!"
msgstr "Es una pena que se desperdicie algo así..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "It takes patience to grow crops from seed."
msgstr "Hay que tener paciencia para cultivar plantas desde cero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "How very efficient!"
msgstr "¡Qué eficiente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "I'd best find a suitable spot for my garden."
msgstr "Será mejor que encuentre un lugar adecuado para la huerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Oh no you don't! Out of my garden!"
msgstr "¡Eh, ni se te ocurra! ¡Fuera de mi huerta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "This will induce quite an airflow!"
msgstr "¡Esto inducirá un buen flujo de aire!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "Not quite the genuine article, but it might fool some birds."
msgstr "No es el artículo original, pero podría engañar a algunas aves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "Oh, how I missed proper writing implements!"
msgstr "¡Oh, cómo echaba de menos escribir correctamente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Feather of Canaria."
msgstr "Pluma de Canaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Feather of Corvus. Or Alcidae?"
msgstr "Pluma de Corvus. ¿O de Alcidae?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Feather of Cardinalis."
msgstr "Pluma de Cardinalis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "It looks like a feather of Cardinalis, but white."
msgstr "Parece una pluma de Cardinalis, pero blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "Poor girl."
msgstr "Pobrecilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "A simply constructed fence."
msgstr "Una valla de construcción simple."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "The post is not conducting a current at the moment."
msgstr "Ahora mismo el poste no conduce la corriente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "The post is conducting a current just strong enough to deter uninsulated creatures."
msgstr "El poste conduce una corriente lo bastante potente como para ahuyentar a criaturas sin aislamiento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "This is an electric fence post and it must be planted before it can be used."
msgstr "Es el poste de una valla eléctrica y debe colocarse para poder usarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "That is a wooden gate."
msgstr "Una puerta de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden gate."
msgstr "Todos los componentes para una puerta de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden fence."
msgstr "Todos los componentes para una valla de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "Unpleasant to the eye, but I suppose practicality outweighs aesthetics."
msgstr "No es muy bonita, pero supongo que la funcionalidad está por encima del aspecto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "Sometimes sharpness is necessary to keep things aligned and orderly."
msgstr "A veces hay que ser un poco incisivo para mantener las cosas alineadas y en orden."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket of animal feces. Pungent."
msgstr "Un cubo de excrementos animales. Acres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "I'm unfamiliar with the origins of this dish."
msgstr "No estoy familiarizada con los orígenes de este plato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It features quite an eclectic combination of colors."
msgstr "Tiene una combinación de colores ecléctica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "I do enjoy a nice ripe fig."
msgstr "Me gustan los higos maduros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "An unexpected, but not unpleasant combination."
msgstr "Es una combinación extraña, pero no es desagradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "I suppose this is the next logical step after meat on a stick."
msgstr "Supongo que tiene su lógica si ya teníamos carne en un palo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking it brings out more of the flavor."
msgstr "Tiene todavía más sabor al cocinarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "Someone experienced with magic ought to wield this. Like myself!"
msgstr "Alguien experto en magia debería usar esto. ¡Como yo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "A little too noisy for my liking."
msgstr "Un poco ruidosos para mi gusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "They disperse when I approach."
msgstr "Se dispersan cuando me acerco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "Their bioluminescent properties might prove useful."
msgstr "Sus propiedades luminiscentes podrían ser útiles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "That hound is more dangerous than the others."
msgstr "Ese sabueso es más peligroso que los otros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "Dastardly things."
msgstr "Qué ruines son esas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "El proceso de desecado potencia el aroma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "A firestorm can be unleashed with but a few strokes of a writer's pen."
msgstr "Unos cuantos trazos de la pluma de un escritor bastan para desatar una tormenta de fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "El fuego casi se ha autoextinguido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire pit."
msgstr "Una hoguera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Ese fuego está ardiendo a un ritmo alarmante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Al fuego le vendría bien un poco más de combustible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly average fire."
msgstr "Un fuego perfectamente normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Se puede volver a encender."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of fire-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Algún tipo de artefacto lanzador de fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Fuel's getting low."
msgstr "El combustible se está acabando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "Nada que ver aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Pitch that ice!"
msgstr "¡Derrota al hielo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Some kind of whitefish, I believe."
msgstr "Alguna especie de pez blanco, creo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "The sea is a treasure trove of survival resources."
msgstr "El mar está lleno de recursos para sobrevivir que son un tesoro oculto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I've read all about fishing. It should be a snap."
msgstr "Lo he leído todo sobre la pesca. Esto debe ser una caña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "An odorous slab of fish meat."
msgstr "Una trozo oloroso de carne de pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Beautifully grilled."
msgstr "Maravillosamente asado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Salada, pero satisfactoria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "Fish flesh."
msgstr "Carne de pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "A small bit of nourishment."
msgstr "Una pequeña porción de alimento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Salada, pero satisfactoria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Give me some tartar sauce and I'm in heaven."
msgstr "Dame un poco de salsa tártara y estaré en la gloria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Personally I relish a spot of spice on my fish."
msgstr "Personalmente me gusta echar un poco de especias en el pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "A clever contraption to keep seafood fresh."
msgstr "Un ingenioso artefacto para mantener fresco el pescado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Beautifully grilled."
msgstr "Maravillosamente asado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "A hard nodule of quartz."
msgstr "Un nódulo duro de cuarzo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Now that the thermal lift is gone, it descended accordingly."
msgstr "Ha descendido como consecuencia del fin del empuje térmico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing magical here. It's flotation is merely due to hot air being less dense than the surrounding atmosphere."
msgstr "No tiene nada de mágico. Flota porque el aire caliente es menos denso que la atmósfera que lo rodea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "Deployment consists simply of allowing it to ascend upon release."
msgstr "Su despliegue consiste en permitir que ascienda al soltarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "A passive deployment flotation device. I approve."
msgstr "Un dispositivo de flotación de despliegue pasivo. Me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a wildflower. I'm unfamiliar with the species."
msgstr "Es una flor silvestre. No estoy familiarizada con esta especie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Ah, a Rosa Macdub... what's it doing out here?"
msgstr "Ah, una Rosa Macdub... ¿Qué está haciendo aquí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "How celebratory."
msgstr "Qué festivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Plenty of nutrients!"
msgstr "¡Un montón de nutrientes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "You could read by that light."
msgstr "Podrías interpretarla por la luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "It will not survive in these conditions."
msgstr "No sobrevivirá en estas condiciones."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "It's not often one sees a flower with such a powerful aura."
msgstr "No es común encontrar una flor con un aura tan poderosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "This flower lacks the essentials for growth."
msgstr "Esta flor carece de los elementos esenciales para el crecimiento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "These may have some nutritional value."
msgstr "Tal vez tengan algún valor nutricional."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "El proceso de desecado potencia el aroma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Protective gear for full-contact endeavors."
msgstr "Equipo de protección para contactos cuerpo a cuerpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "This strain can be used to brew a rather pleasant herbal tea."
msgstr "Esta variedad se puede utilizar para preparar una infusión bastante agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "El proceso de desecado potencia el aroma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It seems rather senseless to attempt to make a beefalo appear dignified."
msgstr "No tiene demasiado sentido intentar que un beefalo parezca una criatura digna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "Hardened remains preserved by taphonomic processes."
msgstr "Restos endurecidos conservados por procedimientos tafonómicos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "Oh! A specimen fit for a museum!"
msgstr "¡Oh! ¡Un espécimen apropiado para un museo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Paleontological incompetence has produced a sad excuse for a creature."
msgstr "La incompetencia paleontológica ha producido una triste excusa para una criatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "There are pieces of the skeleton still yet to be assembled."
msgstr "Al esqueleto aún le faltan piezas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Sticky fingers will ensue."
msgstr "Se me quedarán los dedos pegajosos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "This one appears to be of a different, more agreeable subspecies."
msgstr "Parece una subespecie distinta y más agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Considered a delicacy in some countries."
msgstr "Considerada una delicia en algunos países."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "A amphibian tetrapod."
msgstr "Un anfibio tetrápodo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "Está durmiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "I'll happily volunteer to taste-test."
msgstr "Me ofrezco encantada para probar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "It was an interesting choice to serve it as a sandwich."
msgstr "Fue una opción interesante servirlo como sándwich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "They're still twitching a bit."
msgstr "Todavía están retorciéndose un poco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Not unlike a chicken wing."
msgstr "No es muy diferente a una alita de pollo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "It has quite a unique flavor."
msgstr "Tiene un sabor muy peculiar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "This would pair nicely with a short book."
msgstr "Esto casaría de maravilla con un libro cortito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "Plant and animal have merged into one in this specimen."
msgstr "En este espécimen, planta y animal se han fundido en uno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "It does smell quite delicious."
msgstr "Huele de lo más delicioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's in a deep sleep."
msgstr "Está en un profundo sueño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Those pests are making quite the nuisance of themselves."
msgstr "Esos bichos ya empiezan a ser una verdadera molestia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "It seems that I can exert some level of control over these insects with this."
msgstr "Creo que podré ejercer cierto nivel de control sobre esos insectos con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "What a nice selection of fruit!"
msgstr "¡Qué bonita selección de frutas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC"
msgid "It may require repairs soon."
msgstr "Parece que va a necesitar alguna reparación."

