#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
