msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "You can just calm right down."
msgstr "Puedes calmarte enseguida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "They won't be playing with that anytime soon."
msgstr "No sé yo si volverán a jugar con eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "Not the most productive use of their time... but it sure is cute."
msgstr "No es que emplear el tiempo así sea lo más productivo del mundo, pero es una monada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "I've always been a do-it-yourself kinda gal."
msgstr "Siempre me han gustado las manualidades."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "They really shouldn't make these things so flammable."
msgstr "Tendrían que hacer estas cosas con materiales inflamables."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "The kits sure seem to like it."
msgstr "A las crías les encanta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "All it needs now is a bit of elbow grease."
msgstr "Ahora solo hay que currar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "Well, hope they can stay with a friend or something."
msgstr "Espero que puedan quedarse en casa de algún amigo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Lofty housing for tiny kits."
msgstr "Una casita majestuosa para los gapachitos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
