msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "Tiene algo antinatural... ¿No crees, Luce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "Tiene algo antinatural... ¿No crees, Luce?"

