msgstr "Parece que es donde los tipos con escamas guardan las herramientas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "Better, but why is it all slimy?"
msgstr "Mejor, pero ¿por qué está pringosa?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Sure beats a paper airplane."
msgstr "Desde luego es mejor que un avión de papel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "Wish it was filled with maple syrup..."
msgstr "Ojalá estuviera llena de sirope de arce..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "Ah, that's too bad, eh?"
msgstr "Vaya... Qué pena, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "So that's where all my good boards went!!"
msgstr "¡Conque aquí han acabado todas mis tablas buenas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "Oh... uh... do I have to touch it?"
msgstr "Eh... Oh... ¿Tengo que tocar eso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "Down deep in a coal mine."
msgstr "Entremos en una mina de carbón."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "Light the way, little lantern!"
msgstr "¡Ilumina el camino, pequeño farol!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "I'm not used to the heat in this place!"
msgstr "¡No estoy acostumbrado al calor en este lugar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "Just needs a light."
msgstr "Solo necesita una luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Is there anything wood can't do?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo que la madera no pueda hacer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "What is this... some sort of sign?"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto... una especie de señal?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "Good, sturdy wood."
msgstr "Madera buena y resistente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Another poor soul with a curse."
msgstr "Otra pobre alma con una maldición."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "That's a nice chest with horns, eh."
msgstr "Es un bonito cofre con cuernos, eh."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "That's a nice horn, eh."
msgstr "Bonito cuerno, eh."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD"
msgid "Ice cold."
msgstr "Congelada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC"
msgid "It's nice and warm. Not exactly something I wanna cuddle up to, though."
msgstr "Está calentita. Aunque tampoco me apetece arrimarme demasiado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED"
msgid "Eh... y'know, I'm not feelin' so hungry anymore."
msgstr "Eh... La verdad es que ya no tengo tanta hambre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "It feels aboot rocks the way I feel aboot trees."
msgstr "Siente por las rocas lo que yo siento por los árboles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Want some rocks?"
msgstr "¿Quieres algunas rocas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Dig, dig, dig."
msgstr "Cavar, cavar, cavar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "Just keep your nose out of my business, eh?"
msgstr "No metas las narices en mis asuntos, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "Looks cozy enough."
msgstr "Es un sitio acogedor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "Now featuring night-time chopping!"
msgstr "¡Ahora también a talar por la noche!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "I bet it's just a pile of rocks inside."
msgstr "Apuesto a que dentro solo hay un montón de rocas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Well then. That's a new one."
msgstr "Pues bien. Este es nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "What a fine choice of building material."
msgstr "Qué buena elección de materiales de construcción."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "Eh... maybe living in a tree ain't all it's cracked up to be."
msgstr "Eh... Puede que lo de vivir en un árbol no sea tan bonito como lo pintan."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. I wonder what it might be like to live in a tree."
msgstr "Vaya. Me pregunto cómo será eso de vivir en un árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "That ain't natural."
msgstr "Eso no es natural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Did the monkeys leave this here?"
msgstr "¿Los monos han dejado esto aquí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "Fake trees? It just ain't right."
msgstr "¿Árboles falsos? Cuánta maldad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "She doesn't look like the one on the back of the loonie."
msgstr "No se parece a la que sale en las monedas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "They're kinda like cattails except... not."
msgstr "Son como espadañas... Pero sin serlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "If a monkey can do it, so can I, eh?"
msgstr "Si un mono puede, yo también, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "I sure hope there aren't any fleas in it."
msgstr "Espero que no tenga pulgas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "This is cat food!"
msgstr "¡Esto es comida para gatos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "I'm not hungry enough for that."
msgstr "No tengo demasiada hambre para eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "I still don't want to eat it."
msgstr "Aún no quiero comérmelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "Isn't there anything else to eat?"
msgstr "¿No hay nada más para comer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "That'll need more than a roll of duct tape to fix."
msgstr "Necesitará más que un rollo de cinta para arreglarse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd rather not muck with that if I can help it."
msgstr "Mejor no ensuciarlo si puedo evitarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "That oughta keep us cool."
msgstr "Debería mantenernos frescos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "I'm happy to just leave it there for now."
msgstr "No me importa dejarlo ahí por ahora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "Looks a little off."
msgstr "Parece fuera de lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Pixie dust tickles my nose."
msgstr "El polvo mágico me hace cosquillas en la nariz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "I sure do like nature."
msgstr "Me encanta la naturaleza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Fancy butterfly wings."
msgstr "Alas de mariposa sofisticadas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "Welcome to the world."
msgstr "Te doy la bienvenida al mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "We're free from the moon's reach down here."
msgstr "Estamos fuera del alcance de la luna aquí abajo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Do I really need to be reminded of the moon during the day?"
msgstr "¿Realmente es necesario acordarse de la luna durante el día?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "Wait a minute, I don't think that's ice..."
msgstr "Un momento, creo que eso no es hielo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "Not a good night to have a curse, but then when's it ever?"
msgstr "Ninguna noche es buena para sufrir una maldición"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "The moon's gone for now. Phew."
msgstr "La luna se ha ido por ahora. Ufff."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon's waning. Time for some peace and quiet."
msgstr "La luna está menguando. Es momento de paz y tranquilidad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon's waxing again."
msgstr "Hay luna creciente de nuevo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER"
msgid "Just aboot time again, Lucy."
msgstr "Ya toca otra vez, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "It's green, like a nice leaf."
msgstr "Es verde como una bonita hoja."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "Still not as good as Lucy."
msgstr "Aun así, no tan buena como Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "These pieces still have a glow to 'em."
msgstr "Estos trozos todavía emiten luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "That's a big hunk of moon stuff."
msgstr "Un trozo bien grande de material lunar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "Seems cozy enough."
msgstr "Parece bastante agradable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "I think it's missing something."
msgstr "Creo que le falta algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "Looks kinda loonie."
msgstr "Parece un poco chiflado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "It's uh, a moon rock."
msgstr "Es una, eh, roca lunar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "I should probably put this down somewhere, eh?"
msgstr "Probablemente debería dejar esto en algún lugar, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "That's in a pretty sorry state, eh?"
msgstr "Está en un estado bastante lamentable, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "Better not disturb it."
msgstr "Será mejor no molestarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Almost could've mistook it for ice."
msgstr "Casi lo confundo con hielo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "It's got a little glow to it."
msgstr "Brilla un poco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "If it works, I'm not gonna complain."
msgstr "Si funciona, no me quejaré."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "I can already feel the static in my beard."
msgstr "Ya siento la electricidad estática en la barba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "Whatever he's doin' looks pretty complicated."
msgstr "No sé qué hace, pero parece bastante complicado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER"
msgid "Looks empty."
msgstr "Parece vacío."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like bottled lightning."
msgstr "Parece un rayo embotellado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER"
msgid "We should bottle that lightning!"
msgstr "¡Deberíamos embotellar esa electricidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "It wants to show me something."
msgstr "Quiere enseñarme algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "Oh great, now I'm really hearing voices."
msgstr "Oh, genial. Ahora estoy oyendo voces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "All back in one piece."
msgstr "Vuelve a estar de una pieza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "I don't get it, why does it feel like we're not finished yet?"
msgstr "No lo pillo, ¿por qué tengo la sensación de que aún no hemos terminado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "I know the drill, let's get you back where you belong."
msgstr "Sé cómo funciona; vamos a devolverte al lugar donde perteneces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "I think it wants one of those moon fissures."
msgstr "Creo que quiere una de esas grietas lunares."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "You want me to get you home, eh?"
msgstr "Quieres que te lleve a casa, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "It wants me to carry it somewhere."
msgstr "Quiere que lo lleve a otra parte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "It's givn' me the heebie jeebies."
msgstr "Me da un yuyu que no veas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Sale un pequeño susurro de su interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Sale un pequeño susurro de su interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Sale un pequeño susurro de su interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "It wants me to take it to one of those cracks in the ground."
msgstr "Quiere que lo lleve a una de esas grietas en el suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "Just how did you get underground?"
msgstr "¿Cómo has acabado bajo tierra?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "Not sure if I should be eatin' that."
msgstr "No sé si debería comerme eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "The smell's enough to wake you up."
msgstr "Huele tan fuerte que hasta te despertaría de golpe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "Might as well help the old guy out, eh?"
msgstr "Habrá que echarle una manita al viejo, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "Still a bit of building left to do."
msgstr "Todavía hay que construir un poquito más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. Whattaya figure it's for, Luce?"
msgstr "¿Para qué crees que sirve, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oddly inviting, isn't it?"
msgstr "Extrañamente apetecible, ¿verdad?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "That's a crack in the ground, eh?"
msgstr "Eso es una grieta en el suelo, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "Guess sometimes stubbornness pays off, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Supongo que a veces la obstinación tiene recompensa, ¿eh, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Yeesh, that's a big blaze."
msgstr "Jope, menudo fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "It burnt down, eh?"
msgstr "Se ha quemado, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "I might have chopped more than once."
msgstr "Quizá haya talado más de uno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Measure twice, chop once."
msgstr "Medir dos veces, talar una."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "That's an awfully pretty blossom."
msgstr "Una flor tremendamente bella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Huele bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's definitely Canadian."
msgstr "Sea lo que sea, es definitivamente canadiense."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "Well, it lays eggs, apparently."
msgstr "Bueno, pone huevos, al parecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "Where's the pyromaniac? This needs to burn."
msgstr "¿Dónde está el pirómano? Esto tiene que arder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "My mouth is watering just looking at it."
msgstr "Se me está haciendo la boca agua de solo mirarlo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "That'll take a pint out of me!"
msgstr "¡Esa me sacaría medio litro de sangre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "What do I do with this, eh?"
msgstr "¿Qué hago con esto, eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB"
msgid "That's one angry bag of skeeters."
msgstr "Es una bolsa de mosquitos cabreados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER"
msgid "I don't think that's ketchup."
msgstr "Dudo mucho que eso sea kétchup."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE"
msgid "I guess there's some justice to it."
msgstr "Supongo que es justicia poética."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK"
msgid "A stuffed skeeter? This is what the kids like these days, eh?"
msgstr "¿Un mosquito de peluche? Así que esto es con lo que juegan los niños de hoy en día, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Blood and guts, eh?"
msgstr "Sangre y vísceras, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Feathery moose baby!"
msgstr "¡Bebé de alce con plumas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Don't be mad!"
msgstr "¡No te enfurezcas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "I should probably leave that alone."
msgstr "Será mejor que deje eso en paz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "Nothin better against the cold!"
msgstr "¡No hay nada mejor contra el frío!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "That'd be the thing I fell through, eh."
msgstr "He debido de salir por aquí, eh."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Wonder where it goes."
msgstr "Me pregunto dónde hay que ponerla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's... it's beautiful."
msgstr "Es... es muy bonita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "Funny little guy, eh?"
msgstr "Qué gracioso que es el pequeñajo, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "I don't like the look of that."
msgstr "No me gusta su aspecto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "That there'll make you one with the forest."
msgstr "Con esto te integras por completo con el bosque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "Don't breathe it in, Lucy!"
msgstr "¡No respires, Lucy!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Mushrooms don't have no reason to be that big."
msgstr "Los hongos no deberían ser tan grandes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "If a log burns in the forest does it hurt my feelings? Yes. It does."
msgstr "Si un tronco se quema en el bosque, ¿hiere mis sentimientos? Sí, la verdad es que sí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It needs a bit of help getting started."
msgstr "Necesita un poco de ayuda para empezar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "It's doing real well on its own."
msgstr "Lo están haciendo muy bien por sus medios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "That rotten log needs replacing."
msgstr "Hay que reemplazar ese tronco podrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "Everybody's got hardships, eh?"
msgstr "Todos tenemos problemas, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "There we go. Everyone needs a bit of help sometimes."
msgstr "Ahí vamos. Todo el mundo necesita a veces un poco de ayuda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Doesn't need us no more."
msgstr "No nos necesita más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Whose bright idea was it to kill the lights?"
msgstr "¿De quién fue la brillante idea de apagar las luces?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "My kind of decor."
msgstr "La decoración que me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Soak in that all-natural light, Lucy."
msgstr "Disfruta de la luz natural, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "That got charred real good."
msgstr "Se ha carbonizado por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "It oughta be green like a lush, choppable forest."
msgstr "Debería ser verde como un bosque exuberante y talable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "It illuminates with all the colours of the wind."
msgstr "Ilumina con todos los colores del viento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "A mí me da igual. A cortar se ha dicho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "I like the colour of this one."
msgstr "Me gusta el color de este."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I should chop it."
msgstr "Tal vez debería talarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "I think it's due for a choppin'."
msgstr "Creo que es la hora de la tala."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "A mí me da igual. A cortar se ha dicho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Well, I can't cut it down now..."
msgstr "Bueno, ahora no puedo talarlo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's made of wood."
msgstr "Está hecho de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "A mí me da igual. A cortar se ha dicho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Chop it down before it spreads!"
msgstr "¡Lo talaré antes de que se propague!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't let that stand."
msgstr "No puedo dejarlo en pie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "A mí me da igual. A cortar se ha dicho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "This one needs pruning, at least."
msgstr "Este necesita una buena poda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "Lookit those mitts! Someone get this tendy a twig!"
msgstr "¡Menudas zarpas! ¡Que alguien le traiga un palo a este bicho!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD"
msgid "I hate you more than anything."
msgstr "Te odio con toda mi alma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
msgid "We need to get outta here, Luce."
msgstr "Tenemos que salir de aquí, Luce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh man. That's bad. So bad."
msgstr "Vaya, hombre. Mal asunto. Malísimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "It's growin' icicles? Must be from Quebec."
msgstr "¿Le están saliendo carámbanos? Será de Quebec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Está muerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "That just ain't right."
msgstr "Eso no está bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "Let's not wake it."
msgstr "Evitemos que se despierte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "You are one strange lookin' pooch."
msgstr "Eres un chucho la mar de raro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "Hasta nunca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like a bird, but worse."
msgstr "Es como un pájaro, pero peor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Let's not wake it."
msgstr "Evitemos que se despierte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Lo siento, coleguilla, pero paso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "All-natural and organic."
msgstr "Es todo natural y orgánico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT"
msgid "A good cap to wear when you're sawing logs."
msgstr "Es un gran gorro para llevar puesto mientras sierras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "What kind of darkness is that?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de oscuridad es esa?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "All of my fears in liquid form, eh?"
msgstr "Todos mis temores en forma líquida, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH"
msgid "Somethin' tells me that's not part of the natural environment."
msgstr "Algo me dice que eso no es precisamente parte de la naturaleza..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "They should have used wood."
msgstr "Deberían haber utilizado madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE"
msgid "Whatcha think, Lucy? Should we try a bite?"
msgstr "¿Qué opinas, Lucy? ¿Probamos un bocado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "I think it's off."
msgstr "Creo que está apagado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "It's nearly still."
msgstr "Casi está inmóvil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "I think it's off."
msgstr "Creo que está apagado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "It's going crazy!"
msgstr "¡Se está volviendo loco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "It's settling down."
msgstr "Se está yendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "This thing just turned on!"
msgstr "¡Esto se acaba de encender!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "It's vibrating!"
msgstr "¡Está vibrando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "That's mighty nifty."
msgstr "Muy ingenioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Nightmares can't hurt ya!"
msgstr "¡Las pesadillas no pueden hacerte daño!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "It's how we built the railway."
msgstr "Así es como construimos el ferrocarril."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "Guess that rain wasn't all bad, eh?"
msgstr "Supongo que la lluvia no ha sido tan mala, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT"
msgid "I would have made a fortune selling this back home."
msgstr "Podría haber ganado una fortuna vendiendo esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED"
msgid "This stuff won't quit!"
msgstr "¡Esto no falla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
msgid "This thing sure helps take the guesswork out of gardening."
msgstr "Esto resuelve todas las incertidumbres de la horticultura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR"
msgid "I wouldn't mind taking the boat out on the lake today."
msgstr "Hoy no me importaría sacar el barco al lago."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD"
msgid "Nice day for rowin', eh?."
msgstr "Un bonito día para remar, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY"
msgid "That paddle looks like it could do some damage."
msgstr "Ese remo tiene pinta de hacer mucha pupa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
msgid "There's nothin' but dirt here."
msgstr "Aquí no hay más que tierra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a whole lotta wet."
msgstr "Un montón de humedad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
msgid "A bit of mud won't hurt ya."
msgstr "Un poco de barro no te va a hacer daño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
msgid "Nothing like a nice day of fishin'."
msgstr "No hay nada como un buen día de pesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE"
msgid "Hm. Could really use a float of some kind."
msgstr "Hum. Me vendría bien un flotador de pesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL"
msgid "Nothing like a nice day of fishin'."
msgstr "No hay nada como un buen día de pesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "Hmph. Guess birds are good for some things."
msgstr "Ejem. Supongo que los pájaros sirven para algunas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY"
msgid "Gonna have to hold that one real carefully."
msgstr "Voy a tener que sujetar ese con mucho cuidado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY"
msgid "I wonder what kind of monster I'll reel in with this."
msgstr "Me pregunto qué tipo de monstruo voy a pescar con esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN"
msgid "Guess there's fish to be caught, rain or shine."
msgstr "Imagino que habrá peces que atrapar, llueva o haga sol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW"
msgid "I wouldn't mind a bit of ice fishing."
msgstr "No me importaría pescar un poco en hielo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "This'll be sure to reel them in, eh?"
msgstr "Con esto sí que se pescará bien, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
msgid "Let's see if the fish are bitin', eh?"
msgstr "Veamos si los peces están picando, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1"
msgid "Yeesh, if I weren't so hungry I'd throw it right back."
msgstr "Jope, si no tuviera tanta hambre lo devolvería."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
msgid "You'll make a good meal."
msgstr "Contigo se puede hacer una buena comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3"
msgid "Never seen a fish so pointy before."
msgstr "Nunca había visto un pez tan puntiagudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
msgid "Don't recall ever trying catfish. First time for everything!"
msgstr "No recuerdo haber probado un siluro. ¡Para todo hay una primera vez!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5"
msgid "Now that's just confusing."
msgstr "Eso es desconcertante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6"
msgid "Sorry bud, but your whiskers don't hold a candle to mine."
msgstr "Lo siento, amigo, pero tus bigotes no están a la altura de los míos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7"
msgid "Sorry bud, but your whiskers don't hold a candle to mine."
msgstr "Lo siento, amigo, pero tus bigotes no están a la altura de los míos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8"
msgid "You'd be right at home in the Great White North."
msgstr "En Canadá estarías como en casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9"
msgid "You'd go well with a nice maple glaze... if we had any maple here."
msgstr "Estarías de rechupete con un poquito de glaseado de arce... si tuviera sirope."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1"
msgid "I was hopin' it'd be bigger."
msgstr "Esperaba que fuera más grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "Just a tiny little guy, eh?"
msgstr "Solo un pequeñajo, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
msgid "Doesn't look like there's a lot of meat on that one."
msgstr "No parece que ese tenga mucha chicha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4"
msgid "Just a small fry!"
msgstr "¡Una minucia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5"
msgid "Weird looking fish, but sure smells good."
msgstr "Un pescado bastante raro, pero huele bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
msgid "Eh, I could take it or leaf it."
msgstr "Podría tomarlo o dejarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7"
msgid "Nice looking fish, eh bud?"
msgstr "Un pescado bonito, ¿eh, amigo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8"
msgid "Looks like the sun came out today after all."
msgstr "Parece que después de todo el sol ha salido hoy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
msgid "Not very polite, eh?"
msgstr "No es muy educado, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
msgid "Did you get lost, bud? Land's back thataway."
msgstr "¿Te has perdido, coleguilla? La tierra firme queda lejos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT"
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy chopping you down one day."
msgstr "Un día disfrutaré de lo lindo talándote."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "This one I can chop, right?"
msgstr "Puedo talar esto, ¿no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
msgid "Nice of it to hold that fig for me."
msgstr "Qué amable, mira cómo me ofrece el higo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
msgid "A part of me is just dying to poke it."
msgstr "Una parte de mí se muere de ganas de tocarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
msgid "Burnt away to nothing."
msgstr "Ha quedado reducido a cenizas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT"
msgid "Anything good in there?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo bueno ahí dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL"
msgid "Hold your breath, Lucy!"
msgstr "¡Aguanta la respiración, Lucy!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT"
msgid "That's a pretty good catch, eh?"
msgstr "Es una captura bastante buena, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED"
msgid "Well, looks like I'll have to go fishin' myself."
msgstr "Bueno, tendré que pescar yo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
msgid "I've fixed a hockey net or two in my time."
msgstr "Tengo experiencia arreglando redes de hockey."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "I kinda liked fishing the old fashioned way."
msgstr "Prefiero pescar a la antigua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
msgid "Let's see if it nets something."
msgstr "A ver si pesca algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
msgid "Better get to it."
msgstr "Habrá que ponerse a ello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's give it a little greenery, eh?"
msgstr "Vamos a darle un toque verde, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "That should do it!"
msgstr "¡Pues ya estaría!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP"
msgid "I think I could pile on a little more."
msgstr "Creo que podría echarle algunas más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's give it a little greenery, eh?"
msgstr "Vamos a darle un toque verde, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "That should do it!"
msgstr "¡Pues ya estaría!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP"
msgid "I think I could pile on a little more."
msgstr "Creo que podría echarle algunas más."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I stand on guard for thee!"
msgstr "¡Estoy en guardia por ti!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "I only cry tears of joy."
msgstr "Solo lloro de alegría."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Perfectly roasted."
msgstr "Perfectamente asada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What do you think Luce, wanna help me chop that? I was only kidding!"
msgstr "¿Qué, Lucy? ¿Te apetece ayudarme a cortarla? Es broma, tranquila."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Me parecen semillas de cosecha nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "You're fond of it, aren'tcha Lucy?"
msgstr "Te has encariñado con esa, ¿no, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Err, moon magic isn't really... my thing... Heh."
msgstr "Eh, la magia lunar en realidad no es... lo mío... Je."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "This'll make the chores go by quicker!"
msgstr "¡Con esto haré mis tareas del hogar más rápido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It's shimmering."
msgstr "Es brillante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "Makes the hairs on the back of my neck stand up."
msgstr "Hace que se me ericen los pelos de la nuca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "This will help me get around quickly."
msgstr "Esto me ayudará a viajar más rápido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "Stay back, greedy rascal."
msgstr "Atrás, granuja codiciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Left nothin' for us."
msgstr "No nos ha dejado nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "What do we have here?"
msgstr "¿Qué tenemos aquí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "That's a big leak."
msgstr "Menuda fuga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "We don't have these up North."
msgstr "En el norte no tenemos de estas cosas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It's not done growin' yet."
msgstr "Aún no ha terminado de crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "It's got some crunch to it."
msgstr "Es bastante crujiente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "It'll grow into a fine tree."
msgstr "Se convertirá en un buen árbol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "What's in the box?!"
msgstr "¿¡Qué hay en la caja!?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Even bread gets sweeter over the holidays!"
msgstr "¡Hasta el pan se vuelve más dulce durante las fiestas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "I only sing for Lucy."
msgstr "Solo canto para Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I'd rather chop than write."
msgstr "Prefiero talar antes que escribir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "Reminds me of the snow-capped mountains back home."
msgstr "Me recuerda a las nevadas montañas de casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "That acid'll be a problem, eh?"
msgstr "Ese ácido será un problema, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Doesn't matter if you're from the Great White North. Still a bird."
msgstr "No importa si eres del Gran Norte Blanco. Sigues siendo un pájaro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Finally."
msgstr "Por fin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I still don't trust it."
msgstr "Sigo sin fiarme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "This is the worst."
msgstr "Esto es lo peor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Funny looking vegetable."
msgstr "Una verdura con una forma bastante curiosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "Hoo! That's a hot one, eh?"
msgstr "¡Guau! Este pica, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "Pretty tiny but it packs a punch, eh?"
msgstr "Es bastante pequeño, pero pega fuerte, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That looks like a big case of heartburn just waiting to happen."
msgstr "Tiene pinta de que te dará una acidez de mil demonios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "I should plant this."
msgstr "Debería plantar esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "More birds! Why is it always birds?"
msgstr "¡Más pájaros! ¿Por qué siempre hay pájaros?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It had to be birds, didn't it?"
msgstr "¿Tuvieron que ser pájaros, no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It's all burnt up."
msgstr "Se ha quemado por completo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Could use a touch of green."
msgstr "Le hace falta un toque de verde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not giving anything to those birds!"
msgstr "¡No voy a darle nada a esos pájaros!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "I call them \"yum pockets\"."
msgstr "Las llamo \"Deliciosas bolsitas\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "I wonder if Lucy would like these."
msgstr "Me pregunto si a Lucy le gustarán."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Huele bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "They're frowning at me with little evil faces."
msgstr "Me están frunciendo el ceño con sus pequeños rostros de maldad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Huele bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "So... senseless."
msgstr "Tan... sin sentido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "I wouldn't want that in my moustache."
msgstr "No me gustaría tener eso en el bigote."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Look at this phonograph."
msgstr "Mira qué fonógrafo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "Almost an axe, but not quite."
msgstr "Casi un hacha, pero no del todo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Using a plant to break stone just feels backwards somehow."
msgstr "Lo de usar una planta para romper piedra parece que es por llevar la contraria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "It actually looks pretty good."
msgstr "La verdad es que tiene buena pinta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "Looks a little blue."
msgstr "Está un poco pálido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "Too hot-headed if you ask me."
msgstr "Demasiado enfadado, en mi opinión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Sure likes that gold."
msgstr "Seguro que le gusta ese oro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Something aboot that guy I like."
msgstr "Hay algo en él que me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "Looks a little blue."
msgstr "Está un poco pálido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "Too hot-headed if you ask me."
msgstr "Demasiado enfadado, en mi opinión."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Sure likes that gold."
msgstr "Seguro que le gusta ese oro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Something aboot that guy I like."
msgstr "Hay algo en él que me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I don't want to make him mad."
msgstr "No quiero hacerlo enfadar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "Used all the parts of the pig."
msgstr "Se utilizan todas las partes del cerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "I'd like to complain to the chef. Politely."
msgstr "Me gustaría presentar una queja ante el chef. Educadamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "What a waste of good pork."
msgstr "Qué desperdicio de una buena carne de cerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "A mere shell of its former glory."
msgstr "Un mero esqueleto de su antiguo esplendor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "It's bacon-stuffed."
msgstr "Está rellena de tocino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "A little duct tape would fix that right up."
msgstr "Un poco de cinta adhesiva podría arreglar eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Sorry! I'm not peeping, I swear!"
msgstr "¡Lo siento! ¡No estoy mirando, lo juro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "He's not MY king."
msgstr "No es MI rey."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "Not a pig anymore."
msgstr "Ya no es un cerdo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "We're a team! Yah!"
msgstr "¡Hacemos un gran equipo! ¡Sí!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Walking back bacon!"
msgstr "¡Tocino andante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "That one looks like he means business."
msgstr "Ese parece que va en serio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Happens to the best of us."
msgstr "Le sucede a los mejores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt."
msgstr "Quemado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think it needs meat, Lucy."
msgstr "Creo que necesita carne, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Would ya look at that."
msgstr "Fíjate en eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Bacon with a tail."
msgstr "Beicon con cola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "Looks to be some sort of tent."
msgstr "Parece una especie de tienda de campaña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "How did they do that without thumbs?"
msgstr "¿Cómo pueden hacer eso sin pulgares?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "A favour I can cash in some time."
msgstr "Un favor que podré aprovechar más adelante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "Looks like something those pigs would make."
msgstr "Parece algo que harían esos cerdos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "I should grow it and then chop it down!"
msgstr "¡Debería plantarla y luego talar el árbol!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Here comes a tree!"
msgstr "¡Aquí viene un árbol!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "Looks like some kinda pirate flag, eh?"
msgstr "Parece algún tipo de bandera pirata, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "\"X marks the spot\", eh?"
msgstr "\"La X marca el lugar\", ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "That really isn't my style."
msgstr "Ese realmente no es mi estilo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "That's gross!"
msgstr "¡Eso es asqueroso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking it didn't help much."
msgstr "Cocinarla no ha servido de mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "Looks like some organic headwear."
msgstr "Parece un gorro orgánico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what it will be."
msgstr "Me pregunto qué será."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "A watched plant never grows."
msgstr "Una planta observada nunca crece."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Time for grub."
msgstr "Hora de comer algo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's got no life left, eh?"
msgstr "Ya no le queda vida, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "The theater ain't really my sorta thing."
msgstr "La verdad es que lo del teatro no me va demasiado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH"
msgid "I think it's about horses or something."
msgstr "Algo de unos caballos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT"
msgid "Not a light read."
msgstr "Menudo ladrillo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "I might sleep through it."
msgstr "Voy a quedarme dormido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s isn't very polite..."
msgstr "%s no es una persona muy educada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Knock off the fire starting there, bud."
msgstr "Apaga el incendio que has comenzado, colega."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Look who it is! %s!"
msgstr "¡Mira quién es! ¡%s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "Someone should rub a heart on %s."
msgstr "Alguien debería darle un corazón a %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Enemy of the forest!"
msgstr "¡El rival del bosque!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, you're an alright sort."
msgstr "%s, eres un buen tipo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC"
msgid "You're not yourself lately."
msgstr "Últimamente pareces otra persona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
msgid "That is throwin' me for a loop, Luce."
msgstr "Me ha dejado muerto, Luce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD"
msgid "Can't do much with that."
msgstr "No sirve de mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER"
msgid "I'll stick to my axe, thanks."
msgstr "Me quedo con el hacha, gracias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "Qué reloj tan elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Creo que no está haciendo nada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS"
msgid "I'm not too good with this stuff."
msgstr "Esto no se me da muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "Qué reloj tan elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Creo que no está haciendo nada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD"
msgid "I don't know Lucy, that looks like a quick way to a bad time..."
msgstr "No sé yo, Lucy... Eso tiene pinta de ser como meterse en la boca del lobo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't know Lucy, that looks like a quick way to a bad time..."
msgstr "No sé yo, Lucy... Eso tiene pinta de ser como meterse en la boca del lobo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT"
msgid "Wish she'd put those over somethin' softer to land on."
msgstr "Ojalá lo hubiera puesto cerca de un sitio más blandito para aterrizar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "Qué reloj tan elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Creo que no está haciendo nada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "Qué reloj tan elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Creo que no está haciendo nada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "Qué reloj tan elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Creo que no está haciendo nada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd hate to be on the receivin' end of that thing."
msgstr "No me gustaría que me dieran un golpe con eso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "I'm gonna reel in a whopper, no doubt aboot it."
msgstr "Voy a pescar uno bien grande, no hay duda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "Whoops, I think I got some jam in my beard."
msgstr "Ups, creo que tengo mermelada en la barba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS"
msgid "Stay away from me, bird!!"
msgstr "¡Aléjate de mí, pajarraco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT"
msgid "I can't put my finger on it, but there's somethin' aboot it I don't like."
msgstr "No sé qué será, pero tiene algo que me escama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "That's too fancy for me."
msgstr "Demasiado sofisticada para mí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "This would go good on flapjacks."
msgstr "Esto quedaría bien en crêpes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It weighs a ton!"
msgstr "¡Pesa una tonelada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Seedy."
msgstr "Semillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "I can't swim!"
msgstr "¡No sé nadar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "This should cook up nicely."
msgstr "Esto cocinado debe de estar muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Looks like a cod."
msgstr "Parece un bacalao."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "Doesn't look edible."
msgstr "No parece comestible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Don't poop in camp!"
msgstr "¡No hagan caca en el campamento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "Chops up food pretty good."
msgstr "Corta la comida muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Better settle in, this could take a while."
msgstr "Mejor ponerse cómodo, esto lleva su tiempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "One meal comin' right up!"
msgstr "¡Marchando una comida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Well, should we eat?"
msgstr "Bueno, ¿comemos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "Nothing sadder than an empty crockpot."
msgstr "No hay nada más triste que una olla vacía."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure makes the camp smell nice."
msgstr "Desde luego hace que el campamento huela bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
msgid "Sure, Lucy. We can feed it."
msgstr "Claro, Lucy, podemos darle de comer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "All ground up."
msgstr "Todo molido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not usually one for fancy spices."
msgstr "No soy muy de especias exóticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "I always sleep better in a tent."
msgstr "Siempre duermo mejor en una tienda de campaña."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "A portable tent! Why didn't we think of that, Luce?"
msgstr "¡Una tienda portátil! ¿Por qué no se nos había ocurrido, Luce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "I love good local produce."
msgstr "Me encantan los buenos productos locales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "Never know when you might need a potato, eh?"
msgstr "Nunca se sabe cuándo te hará falta una patata, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "Lucy and I will clean up, since Warly did the cooking."
msgstr "Ya que Warly ha cocinado, Lucy y yo limpiaremos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "I'll eat a tater in any form."
msgstr "Me gustan las patatas en cualquiera de sus formas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "It cooked up real nice."
msgstr "Se ha cocinado muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It's as big as a boulder!"
msgstr "¡Es tan grande como un peñasco!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Me parecen semillas de cosecha nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "I do love me some plant life."
msgstr "Me encanta que haya un poco de plantas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I like the ones made with real sugar better."
msgstr "Me gustan más los que están hechos con azúcar de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "I don't think they're here to say a polite \"hello\"."
msgstr "No creo que haya venido a saludar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs more water."
msgstr "Necesita más agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "I just don't like the look of that thing... can't put my finger on it..."
msgstr "No sé por qué, pero no me gusta nada la pinta que tiene esa cosa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "What a hoser."
msgstr "Menudo idiota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Filthy feathered menace."
msgstr "Sucia amenaza emplumada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "It's my prisoner."
msgstr "Es mi prisionero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Do you think you're cute? You're not."
msgstr "¿Crees que eres una monada? Pues no lo eres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I don't like to eat things that grow on the ground."
msgstr "No me gusta comer cosas que crecen en el suelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER"
msgid "Sure you can carve a pumpkin better, Luce. Sure."
msgstr "Claro que se te da mejor tallar calabazas, Luce. Cómo no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "This will keep me chopping."
msgstr "Esto me mantendrá talando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "You know why I didn't ask you, Lucy. You would've butchered it."
msgstr "Sabes muy bien por qué no te lo he pedido, Lucy. La habrías destrozado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED"
msgid "This should be fun."
msgstr "Esto será divertido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "I won't say no to some pie."
msgstr "No voy a decir que no a un poco de pastel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Pies are good."
msgstr "Los pasteles son buenos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "It'd better not tip over."
msgstr "Será mejor que no la mueva mucho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'd be happier if it was a giant pumpkin pie."
msgstr "Me haría más ilusión si fuera una tarta de calabaza gigante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "Es una semilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "I should see how much of a punch I'm packing, eh?"
msgstr "Debería sacarle partido a mis puños, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "Makes me feel a bit twitchy."
msgstr "Me está poniendo un poco nervioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "The sparkle is gone from the gem."
msgstr "El brillo se ha ido de la gema."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "It's nothing a good chopping wouldn't fix."
msgstr "No hay nada que un buen tajo con el hacha no pueda arreglar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "A pretty useful guide in this neck of the woods."
msgstr "Una guía bastante útil en esta región de los bosques."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "It hasn't finished the food we gave it."
msgstr "No ha terminado la comida que le hemos dado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "We gotta load it up with good eats."
msgstr "Tenemos que llenarlo de buena comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "Can't chop that."
msgstr "No puedo talarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Pretty enough."
msgstr "Qué bonito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "That must have taken some time to make."
msgstr "Habrán tardado tiempo en hacerlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "I'm not huge on art."
msgstr "Yo soy muy aficionado al arte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Sure are a lot of statues around here."
msgstr "Sí, hay un montón de estatuas por aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Take it easy, eh?"
msgstr "Tómatelo con calma, ¿eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "No more berries."
msgstr "No hay más bayas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "That's a fancy way to eat."
msgstr "Es una forma elegante de comer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Me parecen semillas de cosecha nueva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "It's good for the oven."
msgstr "Es bueno para el horno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "I'll just make something small."
msgstr "Prepararé algo pequeño."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "This coin could use a polish."
msgstr "A esta moneda le hace falta una limpieza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "I'm gonna buy something nice for Lucy."
msgstr "Voy a comprar algo bonito para Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "Not a Looney but I guess it works around here."
msgstr "No estoy loco, pero creo que vale por aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "Nothin' like being owed a favour."
msgstr "Nada como que le deban a uno un favor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "That'll cook up real good."
msgstr "Se cocinará muy bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "I wouldn't mind a taste of that."
msgstr "No me importaría probarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "Let's trap some crabs."
msgstr "Vamos a atrapar algunos cangrejos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "Fresh underbrush."
msgstr "Maleza fresca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "Don't look like no flower to me."
msgstr "No parece harina de otro costal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "Probably won't taste great on its own."
msgstr "Probablemente no sepa muy bien por sí sola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd say it looks good enough to offer."
msgstr "Creo que parece lo bastante buena para ofrecerla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "Yep. That's what it wants."
msgstr "Sí. Esto es lo que quiere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "Is this gonna be enough food?"
msgstr "¿Será comida suficiente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "I don't think it wants this."
msgstr "Creo que no quiere esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "Heh, whoops."
msgstr "Je, uy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "Homegrown."
msgstr "De cosecha propia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Lucy helped."
msgstr "Lucy ha ayudado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Me parecen semillas de cosecha nueva."

