#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_DESC"
msgid "Your Weremoose form is more resistant to hitting obstacles and walks a little faster."
